<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">2KI - Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc1">Wafal</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Wafalume</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha keli cha Wafalume</para>
  <para style="mt1">WAFALUME WA KELI</para>
  <para style="imt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Pfitabu pfa Wafalume wa kwanza na Wafalume wakeli aho ghumwande tsapfikala chitabu chimwe chikulu. Chanza ukugholeka pfiwe pfitabu pfili ahala Ibibilia ya ghumwande ghendo ikemighwa Septuaginti, iyandikighwe kwa lugha ya chiyunani hailapfighwe. Ng'aimanyika baye nani iyandike ipfitabu apfino pfili pfa wafalume wakwanza na wafalume wa keli, au iyapfikile pfikale apfino pfapfili.</para>
  <para style="ip">Imunu iyandike ipfitabu apfino tsakasola simulitsi nyingi tsa ghumwande hayapfandike ipfitabu apfino pfili, lola (1 Wafalme 11.41, 14.19, na 14.29). Pfipfila ng'aimanyike baye pfitabu apfino pfandikighwe tsuwachi na pfikighwe tsuwachi pfiwe apfino pfapfili. Yakoneka ghendo tsapfimalitsika kwandikighwa ahala mfalume Yekonia hayalekelighwe kulawa kuna isi ya utumwa ya Babeli mna ghumwaka ghwa miya tano na sitini na moja ng'ana Yesu yoneke baye. Iwanu wengi iwasomile ng'ani Ibibilia wotoghola ghendo ka ipfitabu apfino pfili pfandikighwa miyaka mingi ya ghumwande kubita ayo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pfitabu pfa Wafalume wa kwanza na Wafalume wakeli pfotupetela tsimbuli tsa chila mfalume wa Isiraeli na Yuda kulawa mna ghamatsuwa ghayatawale mfalume Selemani, ahala tsiisi tsa Isiraeli na Yuda hatsikalile isi imwe. Pfipfila pfotulongela apfila ufalume wa Isiraeli pfaugholeke na kuwa falume mbili, na chila ufalume kuwinza ighali ghake, mbaka ahala tsifalume atsino hatsitowighwe na wanu wa isi tsingi, mbaka iwanu wake kughalighwa kuna isi tsa utumwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Imunu iyandike kabama twetwe tumanya apfila chila mfalume pfayakalile na Imulungu, ka tsakamuwinza ghendo Imulungu au tsakamleka. Wafalume wamwenga tsawatenda ighanoghile hambele ha Imulungu, (2 Wafalme 18.3), wafalume wangi tsawetenda ghehile hambele ha Imulungu (2 Wafalme 21.2). Imunu iyandikike kotulongela mwatsi ka isi yodaha kubweda ka mfalume wake kokala pfinoghile na Imulungu, lekeni ka ng'okala ghoya baye na Imulungu isi yake itsoghaya. Wafalme 17.7 yotulongela apfila Waisiraeli pfawaghoghighwe na kughalighwa kuna isi ya utumwa. Tsawaghalighwa ako kwaaapfila Waisiraeli tsawamtendela nzambi Imulungu na waitambikila milungu ingi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mna ichitabu cha Wafalume wa keli</para>
  <para style="io1">Ukumala kwa tsing'onde tsa nabii Elisha, iyabokele ng'onde ayo kulawa kwa Eliya. Sula 1-8.15</para>
  <para style="io1">Tsimbuli tsa wafalume wangi wa Israeli na Yuda, na tsotulongela iwana wa Israeli pfawaghalighwe kuna isi ya utumwa. Isula 8.16-17</para>
  <para style="io1">Tsimbuli tsa Hezekia, mfalme wa Yuda, apfila pfayelongotse na kumtegheletsa Imulungu. Isula 18-20.</para>
  <para style="io1">Tsimbuli tsa wafalume wakuswa kuswa wa Yuda, na apfila isi ya Yuda pfaitowighwe na iwaniun wake kughalighwa Babeli kuna isi ya utumwa. Isula 21-25.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2KI 1" />
  <para style="s">Nabii Eliya na mfalume Ahazia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 1:1" />Hayafile mfalume Ahabu, wanu wa Moabu tsawalema kutawalighwa na Isiraeli.<verse eid="2KI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 1:2" />Mfalume Ahazia hayang'ali ka Samaria kalaghala kulawa kuna ichiheleto cha kuchanya ichikalile mna ing'anda yake, naye kelagha ng'ani. Apfo katuma wanu kawalongela, “Mghende mkamghutse Baali Zebubu, mulungu wa ghumji ghwa Ekironi, ka nitsohona au sitsohona baye kwa apfino pfanilaghile.” <verse eid="2KI 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 1:3" />Lekeni malaika wa IMNDEWA kalonga na Eliya iyolawa kuna ghumji ghwa Tishibe, “Ghenda uketingane na iwanu iyawatumile mfalume wa Samaria kuya uwaghutse, ‘Angu kuduhu Mulungu mna isi ya Isiraeli mbaka mwoghenda kumghutsa Baali Zebubu mulungu wa Ekironi?’ <verse eid="2KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 1:4" />Lelo IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, ‘Ng'utsolamka baye kulawa mna ilunanda luwasile, kutsakufa ghendo’ ” Apfo Eliya kawaghendela ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse. <verse eid="2KI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 1:5" />Iwanu iwatumighwe woya kwa mfalume, naye mfalume kawaghutsa, “Hebali msumke ukuya?”<verse eid="2KI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 1:6" />Nawo wamwidika, “Munu yumwe katsa kwitingana na twetwe, naye katulongela tuye kwa mfalume, na tukulongele ka IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, ‘Pfihi kuduhu Imulungu mna isi ya Isiraeli, mbaka mwoghenda kumghutsa Baali Zebubu, mulungu wa Ekiloni?’ Lelo IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, ‘Ng'utsolamka baye kulawa mna ilunanda luwasile, kutsakufa ghendo’ ”<verse eid="2KI 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 1:7" />Mfalume kawaghutsa, “Imunu ayo iyetingane na mwemwe na kuwalongela agho yali pfihi?”<verse eid="2KI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 1:8" />Wamwidika, “Kapfala gholole lya mighala akuno msipi ghwa ngotsi ghwa mchuno mwake.” Mfalume kawedika, “Ayo Eliya, imunu wa Tishibe.”<verse eid="2KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 1:9" />Kuya mfalume kamtuma mkulu yumwe wa ing'ondo yaghende kwa Eliya iyelongotse na iwanu hamsini. Imkulu ayo kamghendela Eliya kampfika kakala mchidanando mwa ichidunda, kamlongela, “Ghwe imunu wa Imulungu, mfalume kolonga, ‘Uhulumke kuhisi!’ ”<verse eid="2KI 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 1:10" />Eliya kamwidika imkulu ayo na iwanu wake, “Ka nene na munu wa Imulungu, ghumoto ghuhulumke kulawa kulanga ghukulambite ghweghwe na iwanu wako hamsini!” Baho ghumoto ghuhulumka kulawa kulanga ghumlambita imkulu ayo na iwanu wake.<verse eid="2KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 1:11" />Mfalume kamtuma keli mkulu yungi wa ing'ondo iyelongotse na wanu hamsini. Imkulu ayo kamlongela Eliya, “Ghwe munu wa Imulungu, mfalume kolonga apfino, ‘Uhulumke sambi baha!’ ” <verse eid="2KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 1:12" />Eliya kawedika, “Ka nene na munu wa Imulungu ghumoto ghuhulumke kulawa kulanga ghukulakatse ghweghwe na iwanu wako hamsini!” Baho ghumoto ghwa Imulungu ghuhulumka ghumlakatsa yeye na iwanu wake hamsini.<verse eid="2KI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 1:13" />Mfalume kamtuma mkulu yungi wakadatu na iwanu wake hamsini. Imkulu ayo wakadatu kagheluka kuchidunda, katowa magoti hambele ha Eliya, baho kamlomba, “Ghwe imunu wa Imulungu, ulole ugima wangu na ugima iwatumighwa wako awano hamsini ka chinu chikulu hambele hako! <verse eid="2KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 1:14" />Iwakulu weli wa ing'ondo iwalongole kutsa na iwanu wawo walakatsighwa na ghumoto ighuhulumke kulawa kulanga, lekeni sambi nokulomba uwonele libatsi ugima wangu!”<verse eid="2KI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 1:15" />Baho malaika wa IMNDEWA kamlongela Eliya, “Uhulumke naye kuhisi, uleke kupfuka.” Apfo Eliya kenuka na kahulumka naye kuhisi kwayali mfalume. <verse eid="2KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 1:16" />Eliya kamlongela mfalume, “IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, ‘Angu kwaapfila kuduhu Mulungu mna isi ya Isiraeli mbaka kutuma wanu waghende kumghutsa Baali Zebubu, mulungu wa Ekiloni? Lelo ng'usolamka baye kulawa mna lunanda lwa uwasile, kutsakufa ghendo.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 1:17" />Apfo Mfalume Ahazia kafa ka longa lya IMNNDEWA lyayamlongele Eliya. Ahazia tsakahela mwana mmale, apfo Yoramu ndughu yake kawa mfalume hanu hake mna ghumwaka ghwa keli ghwayatawale Yehoramu mwana wa Yehoshafati mfalume wa Yuda.<verse eid="2KI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 1:18" />Ghangi ghayatendile Ahazia mna ukutawala kwake, na chila chinu chayatendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha wafalume wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="2KI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2KI 2" />
  <para style="s">Eliya kosolighwa koghenda kulanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 2:1" />Lelo IMNDEWA hayabamile kumsola Eliya kulanga mna ichipfulapfumbi, Eliya na Elisha tsawang'ali wamnzila, wolawa Giligali. <verse eid="2KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 2:2" />Eliya kamlongela Elisha, “Kala ahano, IMNDEWA kanituma ng'ende Beteli.” Lekeni Elisha kamwidika, “Nelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mgima na kwa ghwegwe yauli mgima nene sitsokuleka baye.” Apfo wahulumka waghenda Beteli. <verse eid="2KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 2:3" />Lelo kingili lya manabii iwakalile Beteli walawa waghenda kumghutsa Elisha apfino, “Angu kumanya ka leloli IMNDEWA komsola imkulu wako?” Elisha kedika, “Ona nimanya, lelo mwinyamale.”<verse eid="2KI 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 2:4" />Baho Eliya kamdedetsa Elisha, kalonga, “Kala ahano Elisha, IMNDEWA kanituma ng'ende Yeriko” Naye kedika, “Nelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mgima na kwa ghweghwe yauli mgima, sitsokuleka baye.”<verse eid="2KI 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 2:5" />Manabii iwokala Yeriko wamghendela wamghutsa, “Pfihi komanya leloli IMNDEWA komsola mkulu wako?” Kamwidika, “Ona nomanya, lelo mwinyamale.”<verse eid="2KI 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 2:6" />Kuya Eliya kamlongela, “Kala ahano, IMNDEWA kanituma ng'ende kuna ghumto Yoridani.” Naye kamwidika, “Nelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mgima na kwa ghweghwe yauli mgima, nene sitsokuleka baye.” Apfo wose weli waghenda. <verse eid="2KI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 2:7" />Na manabii hamsini waghenda mbaka kuna ghumto Yoridani, Eliya na Elisha tsawema habehi na ghumto, na manabii tsawema kutali chidogho. <verse eid="2KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 2:8" />Eliya katsula ligwanda lyake, kalibota kuya kalitowela mmatsi, nagho gheghola akuno na akuno, na awo weli waloka kumwambu, wabita hanu hanyalile. <verse eid="2KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 2:9" />Na hawalokile, Eliya kamlongela Elisha, “Nongele, nikutendele choni ng'ana nene nisolighwe baye?” Elisha kamwidika, “Nobama ning'ighwe tsisehemu mbili tsa iloho yako ya ukutenda pfihulo.”<verse eid="2KI 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 2:10" />Eliya kamwidika, “Kulomba chinu ing'achidahika baye, lekeni kutsobokela ahala hautsombona nene nosolighwa, lekeni ka ng'umbona baye, ng'utsobokela baye.”<verse eid="2KI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 2:11" />Hawang'ali woghenda aku wodawala, baho kulawila mtuka ghwa moto na wafalasi wa moto, ghuwabaghula awo weli na Eliya kasolighwa kaghenda kulanga mna ichipfulapfumbi. <verse eid="2KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 2:12" />Elisha hayonile alino kalila, kakemelela, “Aba wangu! Aba wangu! Mkulu wa ing'ondo wa Isiraeli!” Naye Elisha ng'amwonile keli baye. Kuya Elisha kasola ghamagwanda ghake kaghadegha pfihande pfili. <verse eid="2KI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 2:13" />Kuya kadondola ligwanda lya Eliya ilimlaghalile, koya kema mmbalimbali mwa ghumto Yoridani. <verse eid="2KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 2:14" />Kuya kasola ligwanda lya Eliya ilimlaghalile na lyiyatowele ghamatsi, kalonga, “Yalikwani IMNDEWA, iyali Imulungu wa Eliya?” Kuya naye kaghatowa ghamatsi na ligwanda alyo, ghamatsi nagho gheghola akuno na akuno, baho Elisha kaloka. <verse eid="2KI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 2:15" />Na manabii awala hamsini iwalawile Yeriko wamwona kwa kutali, walonga, “Iloho ya Eliya ya ukutenda pfihulo yokala mchanya mwa Elisha.” Na waghenda kwitingana naye na wenamitsa pfihanga pfawo mbaka hasi hambele hake. <verse eid="2KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 2:16" />Wamlongela, “Lola, twetwe watumighwa wako tuna wanu hamsini wana ingupfu, utuleke tuwatume waghende wakakubamile imkulu wako, songaha iloho ya MNDEWA imsola na kumwasa mna chidunda chimwe au mna ulwanda umwe.”<verse eid="2KI 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 2:17" />Lekeni wawo wamdedetsa mbaka kona chinyala ukuwalemela, kawalongela, “Watumeni.” Nawo wawatuma wanu awala hamsini, iwambamile kwa matsuwa madatu lekeni ng'awamwonile baye. <verse eid="2KI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 2:18" />Hawoyile kwa Elisha, iyakalile ako Yeriko, kawalongela, “Pfihi tsasiwalongele baye mleke kughenda?”<verse eid="2KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisha kotenda pfihulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 2:19" />Iwanu wa Yeriko wamlongela Elisha, mkulu wetu ka pfaulola mwenyegho, ghumji aghuno ghukala hanu hanoghile, lekeni ghamatsi ghake ng'aghanoghile baye na lidongo lyake ng'alimela chinu baye.<verse eid="2KI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 2:20" />Kalonga, “Ngalileni lisinia lya sambisambi, na mumo mwike ghumkele,” nawo wamghalila. <verse eid="2KI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 2:21" />Elisha kaghenda hana imbwibwi, kasa ghumkele mmbwibwi, kalonga, IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, “Nighatenda ghamatsi aghano ghahone, kulawa sambi ng'aghatsotenda ipfijo pfileke kumela, litsotenda lidongo lya isi limele ipfijo.” <verse eid="2KI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 2:22" />Apfo ghamatsi ghahona mbaka leloli aino, ka pfayalongile Elisha.<verse eid="2KI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 2:23" />Elisha kalawa Yeriko, kaghenda Beteli. Hayang'ali kamnzila, iwasongolo iwalawile kuna ghumji wanza kumwowela akuno wolonga, “Uke ahano, uke ahano, ghweghwe yuna uhalatsa.”<verse eid="2KI 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 2:24" />Elisha kahunduka kawalola na baho kawalighita kwa taghwa lya IMNDEWA. Kuya walawila dubu weli mapinga kulawa kubagho, wawamopfula wasongolo alubaini na weli kulawa mna wawo wose. <verse eid="2KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 2:25" />Elisha kaghendelela na ghumwanza ghwake mbaka kapfika kuna ichidunda cha Karimeli, na hayalawile ako koya Samaria.<verse eid="2KI 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2KI 3" />
  <para style="s">Isi tsa Isiraeli na Moabu tsetowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 3:1" />Yoramu mwana wa Ahabu kawa mfalume wa Isiraeli mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na nane ghwa utawala wa Yehoshafati mfalume wa Yuda, naye Yoramu kaitawala Samaria kwa miyaka kumi na mili. <verse eid="2KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 3:2" />Yoramu kamtendela ghehile IMNDEWA, lekeni yeye ng'ehile baye ka aba wake na mai wake, kwaapfila tsakaimwagha ingutso ya Baali iyaifinile aba wake. <verse eid="2KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 3:3" />Hata apfo, Yoramu kaghendelela kutenda nzambi tsayatendile Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, iyawahonzile Waisiraeli watende nzambi, naye ng'atsilekile baye.<verse eid="2KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 3:4" />Mfalume Mesha wa Moabu yang'ali yofugha wang'olo, naye yang'ali yomwing'agha mfalume wa Isiraeli wang'olo laki imwe na mighala kulawa mna ng'unzu laki imwe. <verse eid="2KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 3:5" />Lekeni Ahabu hayafile, mfalume wa Moabu kambiduka mfalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 3:6" />Apfo mfalume Yoramu koka kulawa Samaria, kuya kawakema hamwe maasikali wake wose. <verse eid="2KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 3:7" />Katuma wanu waghende kwa Yehoshafati, mfalume wa Yuda, kamlongela, “Mfalume wa Moabu kanibiduka. Pfihi kutsoghenda na nene kwitowa na isi ya Moabu?” Mfalume kamwidika, “Nitsoghenda naghwe!” Nene na ghweghwe twa chinu chimwe, wanu wangu ka wanu wako, falasi wangu ka falasi wako. <verse eid="2KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 3:8" />Kuya kamghutsa keli, “Hatughenda ukuwatowa tubitila nzila yachi?” Naye kedika, “Tubitile nzila ya kunyika ya Edomu.”<verse eid="2KI 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 3:9" />Apfo Yoramu mfalume wa Isiraeli kelongotsa na mfalume wa Yuda na wa Edomu. Hawatsunguluke kwa matsuwa saba, iwanu tsawahela matsi gha ukunwa wawo, wala gha ukuwanwesa iwanyama wawo. <verse eid="2KI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 3:10" />Baho mfalume wa Isiraeli kalonga, “Angu achino choni! Angu IMNDEWA katukema hamwe twetwe wafalume wadatu tughoghighwe mna ghamoko gha mfalume wa Moabu?”<verse eid="2KI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 3:11" />Baho Yehoshafati kaghutsa, “Pfihi ahano haduhu nabii wa IMNDEWA, ili kubitila yeye tudahe kumghutsa IMNDEWA?” Mtumighwa yumwe wa mfalume wa Isiraeli kedika, “Elisha mwana wa Shafati kabaha, iyang'ali yomwapfilagha Eliya kwa kumghidila ghamatsi ghamoko ghake.” <verse eid="2KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 3:12" />Yehoshafati kalonga, “Nabii ayo kolongesa ghendo.” Apfo mfalume wa Isiraeli na mfalume wa Edomu wahulumka waghenda kumlola. <verse eid="2KI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 3:13" />Elisha kamlongela mfalume wa Isiraeli, “Angu nina choni naghwe? Ghenda kwa manabii wa aba wako na manabii wa mai wako.” Lekeni mfalume wa Isiraeli kedika, “Baye! IMNDEWA yuyo iyatukemile twetwe wafalume wadatu yatwike mna ghamoko gha Wamoabu.”<verse eid="2KI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 3:14" />Elisha kalonga, “Kwa IMNDEWA iyali mgima, yanimsang'anila, ka si mfalume Yehoshofati wa Yuda baye, nene yanimtoghola, ning'alekile kukwalangula wala kukulola ghweghwe. <verse eid="2KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 3:15" />Lekeni ngalileni mtowa ching'weng'we.” Na mtowa ching'weng'we hayang'ali yotowa, ingufu ya IMNDEWA imtsila Elisha <verse eid="2KI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 3:16" />Naye kalonga, “IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, ‘Muhimbe masimo chila hanu mlwanda. <verse eid="2KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 3:17" />Kwaapfila ng'amtsolyona libeho baye wala imvula, lekeni ulwanda auno utsomema matsi, namwe mtsakunwa hamwe na wang'ombe wenu na wanyama wenu.’ ” <verse eid="2KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 3:18" />Elisha kaghendelela kulonga apfino, “Chinu achino chibewe ghendo kwa IMNDEWA ukuchitenda, yeye pfipfila katsowaghogha Wamoabu na kuweka mna ghamoko ghenu. <verse eid="2KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 3:19" />Namwe mtsotowa chila isi itsungulusighwe ubanda na chila chumji ghunoghile, na chila mmbiki ghunoghile mghugane, na tsimbwibwi tsose tsa ghamatsi mtsidiwe, na mhinye chila mghunda ghunoghile kwa kughumemesa ghamabwe.”<verse eid="2KI 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 3:20" />Nemitondo haipfikile, hawang'ali wobama ukulapfa nambiko, lola, ghamatsi ghang'ali ghokina kulawa ubali wa Edomu! Na isi yose imema ghamatsi. <verse eid="2KI 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 3:21" />Lelo Wamoabu hawahulike ka wafalume awo wadatu watsa ukuwatowa, iwanu wose iwadahile kukinda tsisilaha kulawa iwasongolo mbaka iwabala wakemighwa, wema kuna imbaka. <verse eid="2KI 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 3:22" />Na hawalamke nemitondo tondo, wona litsuwa lyopulika mna ghamatsi. Wamoabu waghona ghamatsi agho madung'u ka damu, <verse eid="2KI 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 3:23" />nawo walonga, “Aino damu, wafalume awano wetowa wawo kwa wawo ghendo. Lelo tukeni tukawaboke ipfinu pfawo!”<verse eid="2KI 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 3:24" />Lekeni hawapfikile hana indalo ya Waisiraeli, iwanu wa Isiraeli wenuka wawatowa Wamoabu, nawo watsuma. Iwanu wa Isiraeli wawawinzilitsa mbaka Moabu aku wowakoma. <verse eid="2KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 3:25" />Wabomola imiji yawo, na chila munu kasa libwe mna chila mghunda ghunoghile mbaka ghumema ghamabwe. Wadiwa tsimbwibwi tsose na wagana chila mbiki ghunoghile. Lekeni waghuleka ghumji ghwa Kiri Haleseti ghuliyeka ghuna ubanda wa ghamabwe, lekeni pfipfila iwanu waghutsingila na waghutowa na ng'umbewe. <verse eid="2KI 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 3:26" />Mfalume wa Moabu hayonile kotowighwa, kasola wanu wake miya saba iwadahile ukwitowa na ghamapanga, tsawabama wabite mna misululo ya masikali wa Isiraeli, watsumile kwa mfalume wa Edomu, lekeni ngawadahile baye ukutsuma. <verse eid="2KI 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 3:27" />Kamsola imwanaghe chaudele, iyabamile yawe mfalume hanu hake, kamlapfa yawe nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa mchanya mwa ubanda wa ghumji. Na imaya ng'ulu iwaghwila Waisiraeli, apfo woya mna isi yawo.<verse eid="2KI 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2KI 4" />
  <para style="s">Elisha komwapfila chitsuka imhingwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 4:1" />Lelo pinga yumwe iyakwelighwe na yumwe wa kingili lya manabii wa IMNDEWA kamlongela Elisha, “Mtumighwa wako iyakalile mmale wangu kafa, naghwe komanya ghendo apfila pfayampfukile IMNDEWA. Lekeni munu yumwe iyomdai kakutsa kuwasola iwasongolo wangu weli yoke nawo wakawe watumwa wake.”<verse eid="2KI 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 4:2" />Elisha kamwidika, “Lelo nikwapfile choni? Unongele una choni ukaye yako?” Ipinga ayo kamwidika, “Nene mtumighwa wako nahela chinu ghendo, ila nina mapfuta chidogho mna isupa.”<verse eid="2KI 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 4:3" />Elisha kamlongela, “Ghenda kwa iwanu iwokala naghwe habehi, walombe pfiya pfilihela chinu, uleke kulomba pfiya chidogho. <verse eid="2KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 4:4" />Kuya wingile, wihindile mng'anda ghweghwe na wanagho. Wanze kughida ghamapfuta mna ipfiya apfo, na chila chiha ching'amema, chiseghetse hambali.”<verse eid="2KI 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 4:5" />Apfo koka kehindila mng'anda yeye na wanaghe, wamghalila ipfiya, naye kanza kughida ghamapfuta. <verse eid="2KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 4:6" />Ipfiya pfose hapfimemile, kamlongela mwanaghe, “Ndetele chiya chingi.” Lekeni kamwidika, “Kuduhu chiya chikalile.” Baho ghamapfuta ghaleka ukulawa. <verse eid="2KI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 4:7" />Ipinga ayo kaghenda kumlongela imunu wa Imulungu, naye kamlongela, “Utsa ghamapfuta agho, na ulihe acho chawokudai, nagho ighakalile mkale nagho ghweghwe na wanagho.”<verse eid="2KI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisha na pinga yana tsimali kulawa Shunemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 4:8" />Tsuwa limwe Elisha kaghenda Shunemu, kuko tsakuna pinga yumwe yana tsimali, ipinga ayo kamlomba yatse yaje chijo. Apfo chila Elisha hayabitile inzila ayo, yang'ali yakwimaghahanu aho na kaja ichijo. <verse eid="2KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 4:9" />Ipinga ayo kamlongela immale wake, “Imunu ayuno iyabitagha ahano hakaye yetu kakoneka ka munu iyelile ghendo wa Imulungu. <verse eid="2KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 4:10" />Tumtsengele chiheleto mchanya mwa ing'anda yetu, twike lusatsi, imetsa na chitasa, yawaseghe chila hayotwangila.”<verse eid="2KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 4:11" />Tsuwa limwe Elisha hayatsile, kagheluka kuchanya kuwasa, kuna ichiheto chake. <verse eid="2KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 4:12" />Kamlongela mtumighwa wake Gehazi, “Ghenda ukamkeme mai ayuno Mshunami.” Na hayamkemile katsa, kema hambele ha Gehazi. <verse eid="2KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 4:13" />Elisha kalonga, “Mlongele, ‘Twona uluso wako waututendele. Lelo na twetwe tukutendele choni? Pfihi tukulombele chinu chochose kwa mfalume au kwa mkulu wa maasikali?’ ” Naye kamwidika, “Nene nokala na iwanu wangu, wodaha kungaya chila chinu.”<verse eid="2KI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 4:14" />Elisha kamghutsa, “Lelo nimtendele choni?” Gehazi kamwidika, “Kahela mwana na immale wake kalala.”<verse eid="2KI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 4:15" />Kuya Elisha kamlongela, “Mkeme ahano.” Apfo kamkema, naye katsa kema hana ghumlango. <verse eid="2KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 4:16" />Kamlongela, “Mna ghumsimu ka aghuno ghumwaka ghukutsa kutsomhaghata mwana mna ghamoko ghako.” Ipinga ayo kamwidika, “Baye mkulu wangu, uleke kungutsukila nene mtumighwa wako, ghwe munu wa Imulungu!”<verse eid="2KI 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 4:17" />Lekeni ipinga ayo kakinda inda, keleka mwana mmale matsuwa ghaghala mna ghumwaka ghuwinzile, ka Elisha pfayamlongele.<verse eid="2KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 4:18" />Imwana kakula, na tsuwa limwe kaghenda kwa aba wake, iyang'ali yopfuna kumghunda hamwe na iwanu wake iwopfuna, <verse eid="2KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 4:19" />kamlongela aba wake, “Litwi lyangu mwe! Litwi lyangu lyotama!” Aba wake kamlongela mtumighwa wake, “Umbape umuyitse kwa mai wake.” <verse eid="2KI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 4:20" />Imtumighwa kamsola kamuyitsa kwa mai wake, naye kakala mmahatsa mwa mai wake mbaka nemisi, kuya kafa. <verse eid="2KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 4:21" />Mai wake kagheluka kuchanya kamuwasitsa mna ilusatsi lwa imunu wa Imulungu, kuya kahinda ghumlango kalawa koka.<verse eid="2KI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 4:22" />Kuya kamkema immale wake kamlongela, “Ndetele munu yumwe na chihongwe yumwe, nimghendele sambi baha imunu wa Imulungu kuya mbuye.” <verse eid="2KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 4:23" />Mmale wake kamghutsa, “Heule ughenda leloli? Leloli si chihungo cha kulawa kwa lwetsi baye, wala si tsuwa lya Sabato baye.” Naye ipinga ayo kedika, “Ghweghwe leka pfipfo.” <verse eid="2KI 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 4:24" />Kamwika ghoya ichihongwe kwa ukumdina, kuya kamlongela imtumighwa wake, “Umwendese, umtende yatsume na yaleke kwima mbaka nikulongele.” <verse eid="2KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 4:25" />Apfo koka kaghenda kwa imunu wa Imulungu, kuna ichidunda cha Karimeli. Imunu wa Imulungu hayamwonile kutali kakutsa, kamlongela imtumighwa wake Gehazi, “Lola nomwona ipinga Mshunami ayula kakutsa. <verse eid="2KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 4:26" />Tsuma, ughende uketingane naye kuya umghutse, ‘Pfihi kulamka? Mmale wako kalamka? Imwanagho naye kalamka?’ ” Naye kamwidika, “Wose tulamka.” <verse eid="2KI 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 4:27" />Ipinga ayo hayapfikile kwa imunu wa Imulungu kuchidunda, kamkinda ghamaghulu, Gehazi kasoghela, yamkunughitse, lekeni imunu wa Imulungu kamlongela, “Mleke! Kana usungu mkulu, lekeni IMNDEWA kanipfisa na ng'anongele baye alino?”<verse eid="2KI 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 4:28" />Ipinga ayo kamlongela Elisha, “Pfihi tsanikulomba mwana, angu tsasikulongele baye uleke kunighutsukila?” <verse eid="2KI 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 4:29" />Baho Elisha kamlongela Gehazi, “Wiyohe ligholole lyako mchuno, sola ing'weku yangu, uikinde mmoko mwako na utsume. Ung'etingana na munu, uleke kumlamsa, na munu wowose yang'akulamsa uleke kumwidika, na ukeke ing'weku yangu mna ichihanga cha imwana.”<verse eid="2KI 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 4:30" />Lekeni mai wa imwana ayo kalonga, “Nelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mgima na ghweghwe yauli mgima, nene sitsokuleka baye.” Apfo kenuka kamuwinza mai wa imwana ayo. <verse eid="2KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 4:31" />Gehazi kalongola na hayapfikile keka ing'weku ya Elisha mna ichihanga cha imwana, lekeni imwana ng'ahumule baye, na kuduhu chinu ichilangusa ka mgima. Apfo Gehazi koya kwa Elisha kamlongela, “Imwana ng'alamke baye.”<verse eid="2KI 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 4:32" />Apfo Elisha hayapfikile mng'anda, kamwona imwana kafa, kawasa mlili. <verse eid="2KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 4:33" />Kengila mng'anda kehindila ghumlango, yeye na imwana ayula wose weli, kamlomba IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 4:34" />Kadina mlili, kamuwasila imwana, keka ghumlomo ghwake mchanya mwa ghumlomo ghwake, na nenge tsake mchanya mwa tsinenge tsake, na ghamoko ghake mchaya mwa ghamoko ghake. Na hayegholose mchanya mwake, baho ilukuli lwa imwana lwanza kutsumbuka. <verse eid="2KI 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 4:35" />Elisha kenuka na kangakanga mng'anda, kuya kadina keli mlili na kegholosa keli mchanya mwake. Imwana katowa miyesa mala saba, na kafumbula tsinenge tsake. <verse eid="2KI 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 4:36" />Elisha kamkema Gehazi kamlongela, “Nikemele ipinga ayo Mshunami.” Naye kamkema. Na hayamkemile Elisha kamlongela, “Msole mwanagho.” <verse eid="2KI 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 4:37" />Kengila mghati kenama hana maghulu gha Elisha mbaka uhanga wake udonza hasi, kuya kamsola imwanaghe, koka.<verse eid="2KI 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisha kotenda keli pfinu pfili pfa kungawatsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 4:38" />Elisha koya Giligali, na tsakukala na nzala mna isi ayo, na kingili lya manabii tsawakala hambele hake. Kamlongela imtumighwa wake, “Ugheleke libigha mmoto uwambikile ichijo kingili lya manabii.” <verse eid="2KI 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 4:39" />Yumwe wawo kaghenda kumghunda kubawa mbogha. Kuko kaghona maghitsi gha kubagho, kabawa maghitsi mengi na kaghowa mna ligwanda lyake, koya nagho, kaghaganagana kuya kagheka mbigha na ng'awaghamanyile baye. <verse eid="2KI 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 4:40" />Apfo wawekila iwanu waje, lekeni hawaghalanzile wamlilila Elisha, “Ghwe imunu wa Imulungu chijo chili mbigha chokoma” Na ng'awajile baye.<verse eid="2KI 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 4:41" />Elisha kalonga, “Ngalileni utimbo.” Naye kaughela mbigha kuya kalonga, “Lelo uweng'e ichijo waje.” Baho mna libigha tsakuduhu keli ichinu ichikoma.<verse eid="2KI 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2KI 4:42" />Munu yumwe kalawa Baali Shalisha, kamghalila pfighate ishilini, pfambikighwe na shayili na pfighate ipfilawile mna inganyo ya ipfunighwe sambi Elisha kalonga, “Uweng'e iwanu waje,” <verse eid="2KI 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="2KI 4:43" />Imtumighwa wake koyila keli kughutsa, “Nitsogholatse kwa wanu wose awano miya?” Lekeni Elisha, kamwidika, “Uweng'e iwanu waje, kwaapfila IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, ‘Watsakuja na chijo chingi chitsokala.’ ” <verse eid="2KI 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="2KI 4:44" />Kawekila ichijo acho, nawo waja na chingi chikala, ka apfila pfayalongile IMNDEWA.<verse eid="2KI 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2KI 5" />
  <para style="s">Naamani kohonetsighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 5:1" />Naamani, mkulu wa iwanu wa maasikali wa mfalume wa Aramu, yeye tsa munu mkulu na mfalume wake tsakamkunda ng'ani, kwaapfila kubitila yeye IMNDEWA kayapfila isi ya Aramu ihume. Yeye tsakadaha ukwitowa pfinoghile, lekeni tsakana ukoma. <verse eid="2KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 5:2" />Tsuwa limwe Waaramu walawa waghenda ukwitowa, kuko wamsola imwali yumwe mdoghodogho kulawa Isiraeli, naye yang'ali yomsang'anila tsing'onde mwehe wa Naamani. <verse eid="2KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 5:3" />Hambele imwali ayo kamlongela pinga wa Naamani, “Ka mkulu wangu yang'aghendile kwa nabii iyokala Samaria, yang'amhonetse ukoma wake.” <verse eid="2KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 5:4" />Naamani hayahulike imbuli aino, kaghenda kwa mfalume wake kamlongela achila chayalongile ichigholi ayo kulawa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 5:5" />Mfalume wa Aramu kamlongela, “Nitsakwandika ibaluwa umghalile mfalume wa Isiraeli.” Apfo Naamani kaghenda aku kaghala pfihande elufu selasini pfa fetsa, pfihande elufu sita pfa nzahabu, na maghwanda kumi ighanoghile. <verse eid="2KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 5:6" />Ibaluwa ayo kaighala kwa mfalume wa Isiraeli, nayo tsailonga apfino, “Ibaluwa aino haikupfikila, umanye ghendo ka nimtuma mtumighwa wangu Naamani, naghwe umuhonetse ukoma wake.”<verse eid="2KI 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 5:7" />Mfalume wa Isiraeli hayaisomile ibaluwa ayo, baho kadegha tsinguwo tsake kalonga, “Pfihi nene na Imulungu iyodaha kughala ilifwa na ugima? Heule miyangu ayuno komtuma munu yatse kuna nene nimuhonetse ukoma wake? Lelo mlole imunu ayuno pfayobama ukwisonga na nene.!”<verse eid="2KI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 5:8" />Elisha imunu wa Imulungu hayahulike apfo, ka mfalume wa Isiraeli kadegha tsinguwo tsake, katuma munu kwa mfalume, kamghutsa, “Hebali udeghile tsinguwo tsako? Mleke yatse kuna nene, ili yamanye ka kuna nabii mna isi ya Isiraeli!”<verse eid="2KI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 5:9" />Apfo Naamani kaghenda na falasi wake na mituka yake ikweghighwa na falasi, kema hana ghumlango ghwa ing'anda ya Elisha.<verse eid="2KI 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 5:10" />Elisha kamtuma munu kaghenda kumlongela Naamani, “Ghenda ukoghe mala saba mna ghumto Yoridani, na ilukuli lwako lutsakuya, naghwe kutsakwela ghendo.”<verse eid="2KI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 5:11" />Lekeni Naamani koka akuno kaghudubuka, kalonga, “Nene tsanighamba yeye yang'alawile kunze na yeme na yamlombe iyali IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake, yabititse ghumoko ghwake hanu hanighula na kunihonetsa ukoma wangu! <verse eid="2KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 5:12" />Angu Abana na Faripairi, imito ya Dameski, ng'ainoghile baye kubita matsi ghose gha Isiraeli? Pfihi sidaha baye ukwogha amwo nihone, na ilukuli lwangu lwele?” Apfo kahunduka, koka akuno kaghudubuka. <verse eid="2KI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 5:13" />Iwatumighwa wa Naamani wamghendela na wamlongela, “Ghwe mkulu wetu ka nabii yang'akulongele utende chinu chikomu, pfihi ung'alekile kutenda? Lekeni yeye chayakulongele mbona chidodo ghendo, ‘Ghenda ukoghe wele!’ ” <verse eid="2KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 5:14" />Apfo Naamani kaghenda kuna ghumto Yoridani, kepfabika mmatsi mala saba, ka Elisha imunu wa Imulungu pfayamlaghitse, naye kela ghendo, na kadegheta ka mwana yoneke sambi. <verse eid="2KI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 5:15" />Kuya Naamani na iwanu wake wose woya kwa imunu wa Imulungu. Naye Naamani kema habehi naye kamlongela, “Lelo sambi nomanya ghendo ka kuduhu Imulungu muisi yose ila mna isi ya Isiraeli. Lelo bokela chayanikughalile mtumighwa wako.”<verse eid="2KI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 5:16" />Lekeni Elisha kamlongela, “Nene nelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mgima, ayula yanimsang'anila, sitsobokela chinu baye.” Naamani kamnanahitsa yabokele, lekeni yeye kalemesa ghendo. <verse eid="2KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 5:17" />Naamani kalonga, “Ka ng'ubokela baye, undeke nene mtumighwa wako, ning'ighwe lidongo lighalighwe na pfihongwe weli, kwaapfila kulawa leloli nene mtumighwa wako sitsolapfa baye nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa, wala kumtambikila mulungu yungi ila kwa IMNDEWA iyali mgima yaliyeka. <verse eid="2KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 5:18" />Lekeni IMNDEWA yambonele libatsi ahala hanighenda na mfalume wangu mna ing'anda ya Rimoni mulungu wa Aramu, nikename na kumtambikila ayo Imulungu Rimoni. Nomlomba ghendo IMNDEWA yambonele libatsi!”<verse eid="2KI 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 5:19" />Elisha kamlongela, “Ghenda tseghamba.” Naye Naamani koka. Lekeni Naamani hayang'ali ng'ana yapfike kutali baye, <verse eid="2KI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 5:20" />Gehazi, mtumighwa wa Elisha imunu wa Imulungu, kelongela imwenyegho, “Mkulu wangu, kamlekekelela pfipfino ghendo Naamani, Muaramu ayuno yoke bila kubokela chinu. Nene nelaha kwa IMNDEWA iyali mgima, nene notsuma nomuwinza ghendo yangaye chinu chochose.” <verse eid="2KI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 5:21" />Apfo Gehazi kamuwinza. Naamani. Naye Naamani hayamwonile kotsuma komuwinza, kahulumka mna ghumtuka ghwake kaghenda kwitingana naye, kamghutsa, “Pfihi chila chinu cha ghoya?” <verse eid="2KI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 5:22" />Gehazi kamwidika, “Chila chinu chinogha, lekeni mkulu wangu kanituma nikolongele ka wamtsila wanu weli kulawa mna isi ya ipfidunda pfa Efuraimu, kuna likingili lya wamanabii. Apfo kokulomba uweng'e pfihande elufu ndatu pfa fetsa na maghwanda meli ighanoghile.”<verse eid="2KI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 5:23" />Naamani kamlongela, “Nokulomba sola pfihande elufu sita pfa fetsa.” Kamnanahitsa Gehazi yatsibokele, na katsoha sendi atso mna mikoba mili, na ghamabwende. Kaweng'a weli mna iwatumighwa, nawo waiduta waghenda hamwe na Gehazi. <verse eid="2KI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 5:24" />Gehanzi hayapfikile kuchidunda kwayang'ali yokala Elisha, kasola imikoba ayo mili, kaingitsa mng'anda, kuya kawaleka iwatumighwa awo woke. <verse eid="2KI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 5:25" />Kuya kengila mng'anda kema hambele ha Elisha, mkulu wake. Elisha kamghutsa, “Tsauli kwani?” Gehazi kamwidika, “Nene mtumighwa wako sighendile kokose baye.”<verse eid="2KI 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 5:26" />Lekeni Elisha kamlongela, “Pfihi iloho yangu ng'aighendile na ghweghwe baye ahala imunu hayahulumke kulawa mna ghumtuka ghwake na kwitingana naghwe? Angu sambi matsuwa gha ukubokela tsisendi na magwanda, na mighunda ya mitseituni na mitsabibu na wang'olo na wang'ombe na watumighwa wamale na wapinga? <verse eid="2KI 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 5:27" />Lelo ukoma wa Naamani utsokutsila ghweghwe na lukolo lwako matsuwa ghose.” Apfo Gehazi koka akuno kana ukoma, na kawa mtselu chwee.<verse eid="2KI 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2KI 6" />
  <para style="s">Hoya yoyeluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 6:1" />Tsuwa limwe, kingili lya manabii wamlongela Elisha, “Hanu ahano hatukala twetwe hadohado ng'ani. <verse eid="2KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 6:2" />Utuleke tughende kuna ghumto Yoridani tukagane imibiki, twitsengele hanu hatsotwenela.” Naye kawedika, “Ghendani!”<verse eid="2KI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 6:3" />Kuya yumwe wawo kamlongela, “Twokulomba tughende naghwe.” Elisha kamwidika, “Pfinogha.” <verse eid="2KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 6:4" />Apfo Elisha kaghenda nawo. Na hawapfikile kuna ghumto Yoridani, wanza ukugana imibiki. <verse eid="2KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 6:5" />Munu yumwe hayang'ali yogana ghumbiki, ihoya yake isomoka mna ghumhini ghwake, ilaghalila mmatsi, baho kalila kalonga, “Wenye ghwee! Imane nitendatsa! Ihoya yenyegho tuyatsima!”<verse eid="2KI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 6:6" />Imunu wa Imulungu kamghutsa, “Ilaghalile kwani?” Imunu ayo kamlangusa. Elisha naye kagana lubiki, kalwasa ahala hailaghalile, na baho ihoya yeluka mchanya mwa ghamatsi. <verse eid="2KI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 6:7" />Elisha kamlongela imunu ayo, “Isole.” Naye kagholosa ghumoko ghwake, kaisola.<verse eid="2KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waaramu wotowighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 6:8" />Mfalume wa Aramu yang'ali yetowa na isi ya Isiraeli. Baho, kawalongela iwakulu wake wa ing'ondo, “Nitsakwika indalo yangu hanu ahano au ahala.” <verse eid="2KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 6:9" />Imunu wa Imulungu katuma nume kwa mfalume wa Isiraeli, kamlongela, “Walangitse haubita hanu ahala, kwaapfila Waaramu wohulumkila baho.” <verse eid="2KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 6:10" />Kuya mfalume wa Isiraeli katuma maasikali wakakaghule hanu ahala hayalongile. Elisha kamkanya mfalume ayo si mala lumwe baye wala mala mbili. <verse eid="2KI 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 6:11" />Ichinu achino chimdesa ghendo mfalume wa Aramu, naye kawakema iwakulu wake wa ing'ondo kawaghutsa, “Lelo nongeleni, nani mna twetwe iyali ubali wa mfalume wa Isiraeli?”<verse eid="2KI 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 6:12" />Mkulu wake yumwe kamlongela, “Kuduhu munu iyotubiduka, ghwe mfalume wangu, lekeni Elisha iyali ako Isiraeli. Yeye komlongela mfalume wa Isiraeli chochose achila chaulonga, hata ka kwamna ichiheleto chako cha ukuwasa.”<verse eid="2KI 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 6:13" />Mfalume kawalongela, “Ghendani mkambame kwayali, na nene nitsowatuma mkamghoghe.” Baho wamlongela ka Elisha ka ako Dotani. <verse eid="2KI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 6:14" />Kuya katuma falasi na mituka ya ing'ondo, na wanu wengi iwadahile ukwitowa ghoya, wapfika nechilo waghutsingila ghumji aghwo. <verse eid="2KI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 6:15" />Nemitondotondo imtumighwa wa imunu wa Imulungu kalamka kalawa kunze, baho kawona iwanu, wafalasi na imituka yawo waghupfingila ghumji. Baho kalonga, “Tughaya ghwe mkulu wangu! Lelo tutendetse?”<verse eid="2KI 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 6:16" />Elisha kamwidika, “Uleke ukupfuka, kwaapfila iwali hamwe na twetwe wa wengi kubita awala iwali hamwe na wawo.”<verse eid="2KI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 6:17" />Baho Elisha kalomba, “Ghwe IMNDEWA, umfumbule tsinenge tsake, yone.” Baho IMNDEWA kamfumbula tsinenge tsake, na baho kona chidunda chimema wafalasi na mituka ya moto ya ing'ondo, imtsunguluka Elisha.<verse eid="2KI 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 6:18" />Iwanu wa Aramu hawahulumke waghende wakamtowe, Elisha kamlomba IMNDEWA, kalonga, “Nokulomba uwatende iwanu awano wawe pfipfita!” Apfo IMNDEWA kawetenda wawe pfipfita, ka Elisha pfayalombile.<verse eid="2KI 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 6:19" />Kuya Elisha kawalongela, “Mwemwe mwagha inzila, aghuno si ghumji ghwamghubama baye. Niwinzeni, na nene nitsowahilika kwa imunu ayula yamumbama.” Naye kawalongotsa mbaka Samaria.<verse eid="2KI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 6:20" />Nawo hawengile Samaria Elisha kalomba, “Ghwe IMNDEWA uwafumbule iwanu awano tsinenge tsawo wone.” IMNDEWA kawafumbula tsinenge tsawo, nawo webona wamghati mwa ghumji ghwa Samaria.<verse eid="2KI 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 6:21" />Mfalume wa Isiraeli hayawonile Waaramu, kamghutsa Elisha, “Aba wangu, pfihi niwakome?” Ooh, pfihi niwakome?<verse eid="2KI 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 6:22" />Elisha kamwidika, “Baye, Uleke kuwakoma. Angu hauwaghogha iwanu kwa lipanga lyako na kwa iminde yako kowakoma? Uweng'e ichijo na matsi, waje na wanwe, kuya woye kwa imkulu wawo.” <verse eid="2KI 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 6:23" />Apfo kawatendela chihungo chikulu. Na ahala hawamalitse ukuja na ukunwa, kawaleka woke, nawo woya kwa mkulu wawo. Kulawa baho wanu wa Aramu ng'awaghendile keli baye kuitowa isi ya Isiraeli.<verse eid="2KI 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghumji ghwa Samaria yotowighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 6:24" />Matsuwa chidogho hambele, Beni Hadadi mfalume wa Aramu, kawakema maasikali wake wose ukwitowa, waghenda kughupfingila ghumji ghwa Samaria. <verse eid="2KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 6:25" />Apfo lelo tsakuna nzala ng'ulu mna isi ya Samaria, na litwi lya chihongwe liutsighwa kwa pfihande semanini pfa fetsa, na glamu miya ya mipfi ya njiwa iutsighwa kwa pfihande pfitano pfa fetsa.<verse eid="2KI 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 6:26" />Mfalume wa Isiraeli hayang'ali yopfosa mna ubanda wa ighumji, kahulika pinga yumwe komlilila, “Nyapfile ghwe mkulu wangu mfalume!” <verse eid="2KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 6:27" />Mfalume kamwidika, “Ka IMNDEWA ng'okwapfila baye, nene nidahatse ukukwapfila? Pfihi nikwing'e ingano kulawa hana ichibwalu cha ukubetela au nikwing'e idipfai kulawa hanu hakukamulila?” <verse eid="2KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 6:28" />Kuya kamghutsa, “Ubama choni?” Naye kamwidika, “Ipinga ayuno kanongela, ‘Leloli umlapfe imwanagho tumje, kuya ilupfi nomlapfa imwanangu tumje.’ <verse eid="2KI 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 6:29" />Apfo tumwambika imwanangu tumja, na ilupfi haipfikile nimlongela yamlapfe imwanaghe tumje, lekeni yeye kampfisa imwanaghe!”<verse eid="2KI 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 6:30" />Mfalume hayahulike chayalongile ipinga ayo, kadegha tsinguwo tsake kwa usungu, na baho iwanu wona ka tsakapfala ghunila. <verse eid="2KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 6:31" />Naye kalonga, “Imulungu yandiye leloli, ka litwi lya Elisha mwana wa Shafati ng'alitsoganighwa leloli!” <verse eid="2KI 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 6:32" />Elisha tsakakala ukaye yake na iwanzehe tsawakala naye, na mfalume tsakatuma munu yalongole, lekeni hata ng'ana yapfike baye, Elisha kawalongela iwanzehe awo, “Mwakona imunu ayuno mkoma wanu katuma munu yatse yadumule litwi lyangu. Lelo imunu iyatumighwe hayopfika, muhinde ghumlango, mleke kumleka yengile mng'anda, kwaapfila mfalume imwenyegho kakuchughu kakutsa.” <verse eid="2KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 6:33" />Elisha hayang'ali yolonga nawo, imunu iyatumighwe kapfika kalonga, “Maghayo aghano gholawa kwa IMNDEWA! Heule nene ng'endelele kumbeta keli?”<verse eid="2KI 6:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2KI 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 7:1" />Elisha kalonga, “Tegheletsa chayolonga IMNDEWA, ilupfi saa ka aino, makimbo madatu gha utimbo wa ngano ghatsoutsighwa kwa shekeli imwe ya fetsa, makimbo sita gha shayiri ghatsoutsighwa kwa shekeli imwe ya fetsa hana lilangao lya Samaria.”<verse eid="2KI 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 7:2" />Imtumighwa yumwe, mfalume iyafughamile ghamoko ghake mna yeye, kamlongela imunu wa IMNDEWA, “Hata ka IMNDEWA yang'ekile madilisha kulanga, angu chinu achino ching'adahike?” Elisha kamwidika, “Ghweghwe kutsakona kwa tsinenge tsako ghumwenyegho, lekeni ng'utsakuja baye chijo chochose achila.”<verse eid="2KI 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwakulu wa ing'ondo wa Aramu woitsuma Samaria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 7:3" />Wanu wane, wana ukoma tsawakala hana lilango lya ukwingila mna ghumji, welongela iwenyegho, “Heule twokala ahano mbaka tufe na inzala? <verse eid="2KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 7:4" />Tung'alonga twingile mna ghumji, ako kuna nzala, nayo itsotukoma, lekeni tung'akala ahano, pfipfila tutsakufa. Apfo tukeni kuna indalo ya Waaramu, ako wodaha kutukoma au watuleke wagima.” <verse eid="2KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 7:5" />Apfo chisi hachanzile ukwingila, iwanu awala wane iwana ukoma, waghenda akula kwawapfikile Waaramu, lekeni hawapfikile ako tsa kuduhu munu. <verse eid="2KI 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 7:6" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA kawatend iwanu wa Aramu wahulike ka wakutsa wanu wengi wana wafalasi, na mituka ya ing'ondo, apfo welongela. Mfalume wa Isiraeli kawakema Wahiti na Wamisiri watse kututowa! <verse eid="2KI 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 7:7" />Apfo watsuma mna ichilo chicho, waleka ghamahema ghawo, na wafalasi wawo, na pfihongwe wawo. Watsuma waleke ukukomighwa.<verse eid="2KI 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 7:8" />Iwanu awala wane wana ukoma hawapfikile mmbalimbali mwa indalo, wengila mna lihema limwe. Waja na wanwa na wasola fetsa, nzahabu tsinguwo, kuya woka waghenda wapfisa ipfinu pfawo. Kuya waghenda kuna lihema lingi na watenda pfipfila. <verse eid="2KI 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 7:9" />Kuya welongela iwenyegho, “Chinu achino chatutenda ng'achinoghile baye! Yatuli nayo leloli mbuli inoghile, na tung'enyamala na kubeta mbaka nemitondo, twetwe tutsakoneka tuna totso. Sambi baha tukeni tukawalongele watumighwa wa mfalume.”<verse eid="2KI 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 7:10" />Apfo waghenda na wawakema iwanu awala iwobetetsa lilango lya ghumji, wawalongela, “Tughenda kuna indalo ya Waaramu, lekeni ng'atwonile munu baye, wala litsi lya munu, twona wafalasi na pfihongwe wohighwa, na ghamahema ghawo waghaleka ka pfaghali”<verse eid="2KI 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 7:11" />Iwabetetsi wa lilango walalatsa tsimbuli atso mbaka tsipfika ukaye kwa mfalume. <verse eid="2KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 7:12" />Mfalume kalamka nechilo kawalongela wakulu wake wa ing'ondo, “Lelo nitsowalongela achila chawatutendele. Wawo womanya ghendo ka tuna nzala, apfo waleka indalo waghenda kwipfisa mlwanda na kutonga ka twetwe tutsoleka kaye tsetu tukahemele chokuja, na wawo watughoghe wagima na kughusola ghumji.” <verse eid="2KI 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 7:13" />Mkulu wake yumwe wa ing'ondo kamlongela, “Uwaleke iwanu waghende na wafalasi watano iwakalile kuna ghumji, ka ghehile ghang'awalawi ako, twetwe tutsohona, kubita twetwe wose Waisiraeli tukale ahano kuya tufe wose” <verse eid="2KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 7:14" />Apfo wasaghula mituka mili na wafalasi wawo, naye mfalume kawatuma waghenda kwa Waaramu, kawalaghitsa awala iwakwendesa, “Ghendani mkalole.” <verse eid="2KI 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 7:15" />Iwanu awo wawawinzilitsa mbaka Yoridani, na nzila yose imema tsinguwo na pfinu pfawasile Waaramu hawang'ali wotsuma. Apfo iwanu awala watumighwe woya wamlongela mfalume. <verse eid="2KI 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 7:16" />Wanu wa Samaria walawa, waghenda kuboka ipfinu mna ghamahema gha Waaramu. Apfo, ilawawila pfipfila ka pfayalongile IMNDEWA, makimbo madatu gha utimbo wa ngano ghatsoutsighwa kwa sendi shekeli imwe, makimbo sita gha shairi ghatsoutsighwa kwa sendi shekeli imwe.<verse eid="2KI 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 7:17" />Naye mfalume tsakamwika munu ayula iyaghamile ghamoko ghake, yabetetse lilango, na iwanu wambayugha bayugha hana lilango, naye kafila baho, ka imunu wa Imulungu pfayalongile ahala mfalume hayahumke kughenda ukaye yake. <verse eid="2KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 7:18" />Ilawila ka imunu wa Imulungu pfayalongile, ilupfi saa ka aino, makimbo madatu gha utimbo wa ngano utsoutsighwa kwa pfetsa shekeli imwe, makimbo sita gha shairi ghatsoutsighwa kwa fetsa shekeli imwe mna ghumji ghwa Samaria. <verse eid="2KI 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 7:19" />Mkulu ayula wa ing'ondo iyamlongela imunu wa Imulungu, “Hata ka IMNDEWA yang'ekile madilisha kulanga, angu chinu achino ching'adahike?” Na Elisha kamwidika, “Kutsakona kwa nenge tsako mwenyegho, lekeni ng'utsakuja baye chijo chochose achila.” <verse eid="2KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 7:20" />Apfo pfipfo pfailawile, iwanu wambayugha naye kafila baho.<verse eid="2KI 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2KI 8" />
  <para style="s">Pinga wa Shunemi kakuya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 8:1" />Elisha tsakamlongela ipinga ayula, iyamtsilihule mwanaghe yawe mgima, “Ghenda na wanu wako, kakale kokose kwaubama, kwaapfila IMNDEWA kaghala nzala muisi, nayo itsokala kwa miyaka saba.” <verse eid="2KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 8:2" />Apfo ipinga ayo kenuka, katenda ka imunu wa Imulungu pfayamlongele. Apfo yeye na iwanu wa akaye yake woka, waghenda kukala mna isi ya Wafilisti kwa miyaka saba. <verse eid="2KI 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 8:3" />Miyaka saba haimalile, koya kulawa mna isi ya Wafilisti, kaghenda kwa mfalume kulomba ng'anda yake na isi yake. <verse eid="2KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 8:4" />Mfalume yang'ali yolonga na Gehazi, mtumighwa wa imunu wa IMNDEWA, kamlongela, “Nongele ghose ghayatendile Elisha.” <verse eid="2KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 8:5" />Na hayang'ali komlongela mfalume apfila Elisha pfayamtsilihule imunu iyafile, baho kalawila ipinga ayula yana imwana Elisha iyamtsilihule, katsa kumlomba mfalume yamwing'e ng'anda yake na isi yake. Gehazi kamlongela, “Mfalume wangu pinga mwenyegho yuyo ayuno, na ayuno yuyo mwanaghe, Elisha iyamtsilihule.” <verse eid="2KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 8:6" />Mfalume kamghutsa ipinga ayo, naye kamlongela chila chinu. Apfo mfalume kamsaghulila mkulu wake yumweli wa maasikali, kamlongela, “Muyitsile chila chinu chili chake, sendi tsake tsose tsilawile mna imighunda yake kulawa tsuwa alila liyailekile.”<verse eid="2KI 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisha na mfalume Beni hadadi wa Siriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 8:7" />Kuya Elisha kaghenda Dameski, akuno mfalume Ben hadadi wa Aramu yang'ali yoghula. Iwanu wamlongela ka munu wa Imulungu ka Dameski. <verse eid="2KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 8:8" />Baho kamlongela Hazaeli, “Kinda chinu mmoko mwako ughende uketingane na imunu wa Imulungu, mghutse IMNDEWA kwa mlomo wake, pfihi nitsohona utamu auno au sitsohona baye?” <verse eid="2KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 8:9" />Hazaeli kaghenda kwitingana na Elisha akuno kaduta ipfinu pfa ikumghweka, ipfinoghile ipfilawa Dameski, ka mitsigho ya ngamia alubaini. Hayengile mng'anda kema habehi naye kamlongela, “Imwanagho Ben hadadi mfalume wa Aramu kanituma nikughutse apfino, ‘Pfihi utamu wangu nitsohona?’ ”<verse eid="2KI 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 8:10" />Elisha kamwidika, “Ghenda ukamlongele, ‘Kutsohona ghendo.’ ” Lekeni IMNDEWA kanangusa yeye katsakufa. <verse eid="2KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 8:11" />Baho Elisha kamtsodolela tsinenge kwa wogha mbaka Hazaeli kona chinyala, Baho imunu wa Imulungu kanza ukulila. <verse eid="2KI 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 8:12" />Na Hazaeli kamghutsa, “Heule hulila mkulu wangu?” “Nolila kwaapfila nomanya ghehile ghautsowatendela iwanu wa Isiraeli.” Kutsotsilakatsa tsing'anda tsawo na kuwakoma iwana wawo kwa mimaghe, kutsowadughadugha iwana wawo wadowado, na kutsowadegha iwapinga wana inda. <verse eid="2KI 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 8:13" />Hazaeli kalonga, “Lekeni nene mtumighwa wako inili yumbwa hela, nidahatse kutenda pfinu apfo pfikulu?” Elisha kamwidika, “IMNDEWA kanangusa ka ghweghwe kutsakuwa mfalume wa Aramu.” <verse eid="2KI 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 8:14" />Kuya Hazaeli kamleka Elisha, koya kwa mkulu wake. Naye mfalume Beni hadadi imkulu wake, kamghutsa, “Elisha yakulongele choni?” Hazaeli kamwidika, “Kanongela ghweghwe kutsohona ghendo.” <verse eid="2KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 8:15" />Tsuwa lya keli kasola gholole tsito, kalipfulamsa mna ghamatsi kuya kamghubika mchihanga mabka kafa. Kuya Hazaeli kawa mfalume hanu hake.<verse eid="2KI 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Yehoramu wa isi ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 8:16" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa tano ghwa mfalume Yoramu mwana wa Ahabu mfalume wa Isiraeli, Yehoramu mwana wa Yehoshafati hayakalile mfalume wa Yuda kanza kutawala. <verse eid="2KI 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 8:17" />Yeye tsakana miyaka salasini na mili hayawile mfalume, naye katawala Yerusalemu kwa miyaka minane. <verse eid="2KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 8:18" />Kawinza nzila tsihile tsa wafalume wa Isiraeli, ka ilukolo lwa Ahabu pfalutendile, kwaapfila tsakamkwela neghe Ahabu. Kamtendela nzambi IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 8:19" />Lekeni IMNDEWA ng'abamile baye kuihinya isi ya Yuda, kwajili ya imtumighwa wake Daudi, kwaapfila tsakamlongela ka iwatsukulu wake watsoghendelela kutawala matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="2KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 8:20" />Mna ghamatsuwa gha Yehoramu, iwanu wa Edomu waubiduka ufalume wa Yuda, nawo wamsaghula mfalume wawo iwenyegho. <verse eid="2KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 8:21" />Apfo Yehoramu kaghenda Zairi na mituka yake yose ya ukukweghighwa na falasi. Kalawa nechilo kaghenda kuwatowa Waedomu iwamtsunguluke yeye na maasikali wake. Lekeni iwanu wake wa ing'ondo watsumila ukaye. <verse eid="2KI 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 8:22" />Na mbaka leloli aino iwanu wa Edomu wolema kutawalighwa na iwanu wa Wayuda. Mna ghamatsuwa ghagho nawo iwanu wa Libina waibiduka Yuda.<verse eid="2KI 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 8:23" />Aghala ghose ghayatendile Yehoramu, pfihi ng'aghandikighwe baye mna ichitabu ukukumbuka wafalume wa Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 8:24" />Yehoramu kafa na katsikighwa mna ikaye ya Daudi, naye Ahazia imwanaghe kawa mfalume hanu hake.<verse eid="2KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Ahazia wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 22:1-6">2 Mmats 22:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 8:25" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na mbili ghwa Yoramu mwana wa Ahabu mfalume wa Isiraeli, Ahazia mwana wa Yehoramu mfalume wa Yuda kanza kutawala. <verse eid="2KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 8:26" />Ahazia tsakana miyaka ishilini na mili hayawile mfalume, naye katawala Yerusalemu kwa mwaka ghumwe. Mai wake tsakakemighwa Atalia, mtsukulu wa mfalume Omri wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 8:27" />Kwaapfila yeye tsakakwela mna ing'anda ya Ahabu, katenda ghaghala ghawatendile iwanu wake Ahabu, na kamtendela ghehile IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 8:28" />Mfalume Ahazia kelongotsa na Yoramu mwana wa Ahabu, waghenda ukwitowa na Hazaeli mfalume wa Aramu ako Ramoti Gileadi. Na kuko iwanu wa Aramu wamlagha Yoramu. <verse eid="2KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 8:29" />Apfo mfalume Yoramu koya mna isi ya Yezireeli yahone pfilonda pfake pfawamlaghile iwanu wa Aramu ako Ramoti hawang'ali wetowa na mfalume wa Aramu. Naye Ahazia mwana wa Yehoramu mfalume wa Yuda kahulumka kaghenda Yezireeli kumwona Yoramu mwana wa Ahabu, kwaapfila tsakana pfilonda.<verse eid="2KI 8:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2KI 9" />
  <para style="s">Yehu kobakighwa mapfuta yawe mfalume wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 9:1" />Nabii Elisha kamkema munu yumwe kulawa mna likingili lya manabii kamlongela, “Wisafulule usole supa aino ya mapfuta, kuya ughende Ramoti ili muisi ya Gileadi. <verse eid="2KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 9:2" />Hautsopfika ako umbame Yehu mwana wa Yehoshafati, na mtsukulu wa Nimshi. Mghendele, mlongele yakale kutali na wayaghe. Kuya umwingitse mna chiheleto ichili mghati. <verse eid="2KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 9:3" />Pfipfila sola isupa aino ummwaghile mwitwi, kuya umlongele IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, ‘Nikusaghula uwe mfalume wa Isiraeli.’ Na baho pfughula ghumlango utsume, uleke kukawa.”<verse eid="2KI 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 9:4" />Apfo imsongolo ayo nabii kaghenda Ramoti Gileadi. <verse eid="2KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 9:5" />Na hayapfikile kawona iwakulu wa ing'ondo wakala hamwe, kalonga, “Ghwe mkulu, nina mbuli naghwe.” Naye Yehu kamghutsa, “Yuhi yaubama kulonga naye?” Naye kamwidika, “Ghweghwe mkulu.” <verse eid="2KI 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 9:6" />Apfo Yehu kenuka kengila mng'anda. Baho nabii kamghidila ghamapfuta mwitwi mwake, kuya kalonga “IMNDEWA wa Isiraeli kolonga apfino, ‘Nokubaka ghamapfuta uwe mfalume wa iwanu wangu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 9:7" />Kobamighwa uwakome iwanu wa ikaye ya Ahabu iyali mkulu wako, na nene nitsowakoma ka pfawawakomile manabii na iwatumighwa wose wa IMNDEWA iwakomighwe na Yezebeli. <verse eid="2KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 9:8" />Na iwanu wose wa Ahabu watsohupa ghendo. Nitsomkoma chila mwana mmale iyakoneka mna ng'anda ya Ahabu, yang'awa mtumwa au si mtumwa baye. <verse eid="2KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 9:9" />Na nene nitsoitenda ing'anda ya Ahabu iwe ka ng'anda ya Yeroboamu imwanaghe Nebati, na ka ng'anda ya Baasha mwana wa Ahiya. <verse eid="2KI 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 9:10" />Yezebeli ng'atsotsikighwa na munu baye, ilukuli lwake lutsakujighwa na wambwa mna isi ya Yezireeli.’ ” Hayamalitse kulongsa apfo, nabii ayula kapfughula ghumlango koka.<verse eid="2KI 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 9:11" />Yehu hayalawile kunze yaghende kuna iwakulu wake wa ing'ondo, yumwe wawo kamghutsa, “Pfii kuna chinu chochose chilawile?” “Hebali imunu ayuno yana ilukwale katsa kuna ghweghwe?” Naye Yehu kamwidika, “Mwommanya imunu ayuno, na apfila pfayolongagha.” <verse eid="2KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 9:12" />Nawo walonga, “Kwa mghutsu ghweghwe! Tulongele chayakulongele.” Yehu kawalongela, “IMNDEWA kanongela apfino, ‘Nikubaka ghamapfuta uwe mfalume wa Isiraeli.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 9:13" />Baho iwakulu weyaghe watsuma, waghenda kusola magwanda ghawo, waghatandatsa mna tsingatsi ili yemile. Kuya watowa malati na ukukemelela walonga, “Yehu ka mfalume!”<verse eid="2KI 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Yoramu wa Isiraeli kokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 9:14" />Apfo Yehu mwana wa Yehoshafati na mtsukulu wa Nimshi, kamtendela ghehile Yoramu. Naye Yoramu na iwanu wose wa Isiraeli wang'ali wobetetsa isi ya Ramoti Gileadi, ileke kutowighwa na Hazaeli mfalume wa Aramu. <verse eid="2KI 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 9:15" />Lekeni mfalume Yoramu tsakoya Yezireeli ili yahonei pfilonda pfake pfayatowighwe na Hazaeli mfalume wa Aramu. Yehu kawalongela “Ka mwemwe mwobama apfo, Mleke kumleka munu wowose yalawe muisi yaghende kuwalongela mbuli aino iwanu wa Yezireeli.” <verse eid="2KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 9:16" />Baho Yehu kadina mna ghumtuka ghwake, koka Yezireeli, kwaapfila Yoramu tsang'ana yahone baye. Naye Ahazia mfalume wa Yuda tsakahulumka kaghenda kumlola.<verse eid="2KI 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 9:17" />Imunu iyang'ali yobetetsagha ghumnala ghwa Yezireeli hayawonile iwakulu wa Yehu wakutsa, kakemelela kalonga, “Nowona wanu wengi wakutsa.” Baho Yoramu kalonga, “Msole mdina falasi yumwe, yaghende yaketingane nawo, kuya yawaghutse, ‘Pfihi mtsa ghoya?’ ”<verse eid="2KI 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 9:18" />Apfo imdina falasi kaghenda ketingana na Yehu kamlongela, “Pfihi mtsa ghoya?” Naye Yehu kamwidika, “Heule utughutsa apfo? Ghweghwe hunduka utuwinze.” Na ayula iyang'ali yobetetsa ghumnala kawalongela, “Imunu iyatumighwe kapfika, lekeni ng'akuya baye.” <verse eid="2KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 9:19" />Apfo mfalume kamtuma mdina falasi wakeli. Naye hayawapfikile kawaghutsa, “Mfalume koghutsa apfino, ‘Pfihi mtsa ghoya?’ ” Yehu kamwidika, “Heule utughutsa apfo? Ghweghwe hunduka uniwinze.”<verse eid="2KI 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 9:20" />Na ayula iyang'ali yobetetsa ghumnala kawalongela, “Imunu iyawamtumile kapfika, lekeni naye ng'akuya keli baye.” Pfipfila kalonga, “Naye kakwendesa ka Yehu mwana wa Nimshi, kwaapfila kakwendesa ka munu yana ilukwale.”<verse eid="2KI 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 9:21" />Baho Yoramu kawalaghitsa kalonga, “Nyikileni ghoya mtuka ghwangu ghwa ing'ondo.” Nawo hawamalitse ukwika ghoya ghumtuka, Yoramu mfalume wa Isiraeli na Ahazia mfalume wa Yuda woka akuno chila yumwe kadina ghumtuka ghwake, waghenda kwitingana na Yehu. Naye wampfika kuna ichibwalu cha Naboti, munu wa Yezireeli.<verse eid="2KI 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 9:22" />Yoramu hayamwonile Yehu kamghutsa, “Pfihi mtsa ghoya?” Naye Yehu kamwidika, “Hebali utughutsa tutsa ghoya aku iwanu iwotambikila pfinyagho, na wahawi wa mai wako Yezebeli wa wengi?”<verse eid="2KI 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 9:23" />Baho Yoramu kahunduka katsuma, akuno kolonga, “Ahazia ghweghwe kwobugha wanu!” <verse eid="2KI 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 9:24" />Yehu kasomola iminde yake, kamwasila ghumshale Yoramu, nagho ghuluta mmayegha na ghumuhoma ghumoyo ghwake. Naye Yoramu kafila mumo mna ghumtuka ghwake. <verse eid="2KI 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 9:25" />Yehu kamlongela Bidikari iyang'ali iyomwapfila mna ghumtuka, “Sola lukuli lwake ulwase mna mghunda ghwa Naboti Muyezireeli. Ukumbuke ahala ghweghwe na nene hatudinile ifalasi kuchughu kwa Ahaba, aba wake Yoramu, ahala IMNDEWA hayalongile chinu achino kuna yeye. <verse eid="2KI 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 9:26" />Kwa idamu aila ya Naboti na idamu ya wanaghe yaniyonile ahano mna ghamatsuwa ighanibitile, nelighita ghendo nene nitsokulihila achila chawakutendele mna ichibwalu achino. Lelo usole lukuli lwa Yoramu ulwase mna chibwalu achino, ka pfayalongile IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="2KI 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Ahazia wa Yuda kokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 9:27" />Mfalume Ahazia wa Yuda hayonile ichilawile, katsumila kuna inzila ighenda Beti Hagani. Yehu kamuwinga akuno kokemelela kalonga, “Ayo naye pfipfila mkomeni!” Nawo wamlagha mna ghumtuka ghwake hawang'ali woghenda Guri, isi ili habehi na Ibleamu, lekeni katsumila Megido, kafila kuko.<verse eid="2KI 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 9:28" />Iwatumighwa wake walusola ilukuli lwake mna ghumtuka woya nalwo Yerusalemu, wamtsika kwawatsikighwe iwahenga wake mna ghumji ghwa Daudi.<verse eid="2KI 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 9:29" />Ahazia kawa mfalume wa Yuda mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na ghumwe ghwa mfalume Yoramu mwana wa Ahabu kutawala Isiraeli.<verse eid="2KI 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yezebeli, pinga wa Ahabu kokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 9:30" />Yehu hayapfikile Yezireeli, Yezebeli ma tsakahulika aghala ghose ighalawile. Kebakatsa wanja mna tsinenge tsake na katana mvili tsake, kuya kaghenda kuna lidilisha yakasungulile kunze. <verse eid="2KI 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 9:31" />Yehu hayang'ali yakwingila hana lilango, Yezebeli kamghutsa, “Ghweghwe yuuli ka Zimri, yaukoma iwakulu wako, pfihi kwakutsa ghoya?”<verse eid="2KI 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 9:32" />Yehu kalola mchanya kuna lidilisha kalonga, “Yuhi yakuwa hamwe na nene?” Weli au wadatu, awala iwang'ali wosang'ana mna ing'anda ya mfalume wamsungulila kulawa mna lidilisha. <verse eid="2KI 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 9:33" />Naye Yehu kalonga, “Mwaseni hasi ipinga ayo!” Apfo wamwasa hasi, na idamu yake ingi yenela mchanya mwa ubanda na mna wafalasi, nawo wafalasi wambajughabajugha. <verse eid="2KI 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 9:34" />Kuya Yehu kengila mng'anda, kaja na kanwa. Kuya kalonga, “Mtsikeni ipinga ayo iyalighitighwe, kwaapfila yeye tsa neghe mfalume.” <verse eid="2KI 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 9:35" />Lekeni hawaghendile kumtsika, ng'awonile chinu baye ila wona lipate lya litwi na imipate ya ghamatsayo na ya ghamoko. <verse eid="2KI 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 9:36" />Apfo woya wamlongela Yehu. Naye kalonga, “Aino iyo imbuli ya IMNDEWA iyalongile kubitila mtumighwa wake Eliya imunu wa Mtishibi ahala hayalongile, ‘Mna chibwalu cha Yezireeli iwambwa watsoluja lukuli lwa Yezebeli. <verse eid="2KI 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 9:37" />Lukuli lwa Yezebeli lutsakoneka ka mipfi mna ghumghunda ghwa Yezireeli, ili yaleke kulawila munu wowose iyatsomtanga.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 9:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2KI 10" />
  <para style="s">Watsukulu wa Ahabu wokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 10:1" />Ahabu tsakana wana sabini wamale mna isi ya Samaria. Apfo Yehu kandika baluwa kaituma Samaria kwa iwakulu wa ing'ondo wa Yezireeli, na kwa iwabala na kwa awala iwang'ali wolela iwana wa Ahabu. Na ibaluwa ayo yandikighwa apfino: <verse eid="2KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 10:2" />“Kwaapfila kuna mwemwe kuna iwana wa mfalume, na wafalasi, mituka ikweghighwa na falasi, tsisilaha na imiji itsungulusighwe ubanda, <verse eid="2KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 10:3" />nisaghulileni mwana yumwe iyodahaha ukutawala kulawa mna iwana wa mfalume mmwike yawe mfalume, hanu ha aba wake. Kuya mwitowe kwaajili ya ing'anda ya imkulu wenu mfalume.”<verse eid="2KI 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 10:4" />Lekeni wawo wapfuka ng'ani walonga, “Ka mfalume Ahazia na mfalume Yoramu ng'awadahile baye kumtowa, lelo twetwe tutsodahatse?” <verse eid="2KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 10:5" />Lelo ayula iyololesa ing'anda ya mfalume, na iimkulu wa ghumji hamwe na iwanzehe na iwelesi, watuma munu kwa Yehu, walonga, “Twetwe twa watumwa wako, tutsotenda chochose chaulonga, ng'atutsomsaghula munu baye yawe mfalume, tenda chochose chaukona chinogha.”<verse eid="2KI 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 10:6" />Kuya Yehu kawandikila baluwa ya keli, nayo ilonga, “Ka mwemwe mwawayangu, na mwonitegheletsa, ngalileni ghamatwi gha iwana wa mfalume, na mnighalile ilupfi isaa ka aino.” Baho wana sabini wa mfalume Ahabu, tsawakala kwa iwakulu wa isi, iwang'ali wowalela. <verse eid="2KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 10:7" />Ibaluwa haiwapfikile, wawasola iwana sabini wa mfalume wawakoma wose. Na ghamatwi ghawo wagheka mna ipfiseghe, wamghalila Yehu ako Yezireeli.<verse eid="2KI 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 10:8" />Msenga yumwe kapfika kamlongela Yehu, “Ghamatwi gha iwana wa mfalume ma ghapfika.” Baho kawalaghitsa kalonga, “Ghekeni hasi mabughulu meli hana lilango lya ghumji mbaka ilupfi nemitondo.” <verse eid="2KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 10:9" />Kuya nemitondo hakuchele kalawa kunze, kema hambele ha iwanu wose kawalongela, “Mwemwe mwahela totso, nene yuyo yanimtendele ghehile mkulu wangu mbaka nimkoma. Lekeni nani iyawatowile iwanu wose awano? <verse eid="2KI 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 10:10" />Mmanye ghendo aghala ghose IMNDEWA ghayalongile kwa ikaye ya Ahabu ghatsolawila, lelo IMNDEWA kaghatenda aghala ghayalongile kubitila mtumighwa wake Eliya.” <verse eid="2KI 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 10:11" />Apfo Yehu kawakoma iwanu wose wa kaye ya Ahabu iwakalile Yezireeli, iwakulu wake wa ing'ondo, sale tsake wa habehi na watambika wake, na ng'alekile munu wowose baye.<verse eid="2KI 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndughu tsake Ahazia wokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 10:12" />Baho Yehu koka na kaghenda Samaria, hayang'ali kamnzila, hayapfikile hanu hokemighwa, “Ndalo ya Wadimi.” <verse eid="2KI 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 10:13" />Yehu ketingana na ndughu tsake Ahazia mfalume wa Yuda kawaghutsa, “Mwemwe mli tsina nani?” Nawo wamwidika, “Twetwe twa ndughu tsake Ahazia. Tuhulumka akuno kuwakanza iwana wa mfalume na iwana wa ipinga wa mfalume.” <verse eid="2KI 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 10:14" />Kuya kawalongela, “Waghogheni pfipfo pfawali wagima.” Apfo wawaghogha wanu alubaini na weli aku wawagima. Nawo wawakomela habehi na chisima cha Beti Ekedi, wala ng'amlekile munu wowose baye.<verse eid="2KI 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndughu tsake Ahabu iwasighale nawo wokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 10:15" />Hayalawile ako yoke, ketingana na Yehonadabu mwana wa Rekabu yang'ali yoghenda kumlamsa. Yehu kamlamsa kalonga, “Pfii ghumoyo ghwako na ghumoyo ghwangu ghwakwalangula chinu chimwe?” Naye Yehonadabu kamwidika “Ona.” Yehu kamlongela “Ka kolengesa, ngaya ghumoko ghwako.” Naye kamwing'a ghumoko. Kuya Yehu kamsola kamdinitsa mna ghumtuka ghwake ghwa ing'ondo. <verse eid="2KI 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 10:16" />Naye Yehu kamlongela, “Uniwinze, naghwe kutsolola pfanilapfa nimwenyegho kwa IMNDEWA.” Apfo kamdinitsa mna ghumtuka ghwake woka wose. <verse eid="2KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 10:17" />Hayapfikile Samaria, Yehu kawakoma iwanu wose wa ikaye ya Ahabu iwasighale. Naye ng'amlekile hata munu yumwe ka IMNDEWA pfayamlongele Eliya.<verse eid="2KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu iwomtambikila mulungu Baali wokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 10:18" />Yehu kawakema hamwe iwanu, kawalongela, “Ahabu yeye tsakamsang'anila Baali chidogho, lekeni nene nitsomsang'anila ng'ani. <verse eid="2KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 10:19" />Lelo nikemele manabii wose wa Baali na watumighwa wake wose, na iwatambika wake wose, na chila yumwe yawe baho, kwaapfila nobama kulapfa nambiko ng'ulu, na imunu wowose iyoleka kupfika aho, ayo katsokomighwa.” Agho tsaghatendeka ili Yehu yawakome watumighwa wa Baali. <verse eid="2KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 10:20" />Kuya Yehu kawalongela, “Wakemeni iwanu watse wamtambikile Baali” Nawo wawakema. <verse eid="2KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 10:21" />Naye Yehu katuma nume kwa iwanu wose iwokala mna isi ya Isiraeli. Nawo iwanu wose watsa wamema mna ing'anda ya Baali kulawa membe imwe mbaka membe ingi. <verse eid="2KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 10:22" />Naye Yehu kamlongela imunu ayula iyang'ali yobetetsa ghamagwanda, “Ulapfe ghamaghwanda ghose uweng'e iwanu awano iwomtambikila mulungu Baali.” Naye kalapfa ghamaghwanda agho kaweng'a iwanu. <verse eid="2KI 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 10:23" />Kuya Yehu kengila mna ing'anda ya Baali akuno kelongotsa na Yehonadabu mwana wa Rekabu. Kuya kawalongela iwanu iwomtambikila Baali, “Mwalangitse mlole chila hanu, kuleke koneka munu wowose iyomtambikila IMNDEWA mna mwemwe, lekeni woneke awala iwomtambikila Baali yaliyeka.” <verse eid="2KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 10:24" />Kuya wengila mng'anda wakatambike na wakalapfe nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa, aku Yehu kaweka wanu semanini kunze kuya kawalaghitsa apfino, “Muwakome iwanu awano wose. Yumwe wenu yang'amleka munu wowose yatsume kulawa mna iwanu awano waniwekile mna ghamoko ghenu, ayo katsokomighwa hanu ha imunu ayo!”<verse eid="2KI 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 10:25" />Na hayamalitse ukulapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa, Yehu kawalongela iwabetetsi iwemile kunze na iwakulu wa ing'ondo, “Mwingile mng'anda mkawakome, mleke kumleka munu yatsume.” Apfo wawakoma. Iwabetetsi na iwakulu wa ing'ondo wawalapfa kunze, kuya wengila mghati mwa ing'anda ya Baali. <verse eid="2KI 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 10:26" />Wapfilapfa kunze pfinyagho pfa ngutso ipfili mna ing'anda ya mulungu Baali, kuya wapfilakatsa. <verse eid="2KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 10:27" />Waighwisa ingutso ya Baali waibomola ing'anda yake, na waitenda cholo. Apfo pfipfo pfaili mbaka leloli aino.<verse eid="2KI 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 10:28" />Apfo pfipfo Yehu pfayahinyile ichihendo cha ukumtambikila mulungu Baali mna isi ya Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 10:29" />Lekeni Yehu ng'alekile baye ukutenda ghehile ghayatendile Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, yeye iyawahonzile Waisiraeli watende nzambi kwa kutambikila pfiinyagho pfa nzahabu pfa imwana wa ing'ombe pfayekile ako Beteli na Dani. <verse eid="2KI 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 10:30" />Baho IMNDEWA kamlongela Yehu, “Kwaapfila kutenda ghoya kwa ukusang'ana ghose aghala ighoninoghela nene, na pfauwatendele iwanu wa Ahabu aghala ghose ghanibamile kutenda, lelo iwanagho na mweleko ghwako ghwakane watsakuwa wafalume mna isi ya Isiraeli.” <verse eid="2KI 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 10:31" />Lekeni Yehu ng'aghakindile baye ghamalaghitso ghe IMNDEWA wa Isiraeli kwa ghumoyo ghwake ghwose, ila yeye katenda aghala ghehile ghayatendile Yeroboamu, yeye iyawahonzile Waisiraeli watende nzambi.<verse eid="2KI 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Yehu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 10:32" />Mna ghamatsuwa agho IMNDEWA kanza kuihungutsa isi ya Isiraeli, na mfalume Hazaeli wa Aramu kaihuma isi ya Isiraeli mna tsimbaka tsake tsose, <verse eid="2KI 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 10:33" />kulawa ubali wa mashaliki wa mto Yoridani, na isi yose ya Gileadi, Gadi, Rubeni na Manase. Na Kulawa Aroeli habehi na Lwanda lwa Arinoni, mna tsiisi tsa Gileadi na Bashani.<verse eid="2KI 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 10:34" />Chila chinu na aghala ghose ghayatendile Yehu, ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukukumbuka wafalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 10:35" />Apfo Yehu kafa na katsikighwa Samaria. Na Yehohazi imwanaghe kawa mfalume hanu hake. <verse eid="2KI 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 10:36" />Naye Yehu tsakatawala Isiraeli aku kokala mna ghumji Samaria kwa miyaka ishilini na minane.<verse eid="2KI 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2KI 11" />
  <para style="s">Atalia kotawala Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 11:1" />Naye Atalia mai wake mfalume Ahazia, hayonile mwanaghe kafa, tsakalamla kaghenda kuwakoma iwanu wose wa ikaye ya mfalume.<verse eid="2KI 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 11:2" />Lekeni Yehosheba, neghe wa mfalume Yoramu, lumbu wake Ahazia, kamsola chinyele Yoashi kulawa mna iwana wa mfalme iwang'ali wobama ukukomighwa, kamwika mna chiheleto cha ukuwasa yeye na pinga iyang'ali iyomlela. Tsakampfisa ili Atalia yaleke kumwona, apfo Yoashi ng'akomighwe baye. <verse eid="2KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 11:3" />Naye Yoashi kakala na Yehosheba kwa miyaka sita, aku kapfisighwa mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, ahala Atalia hayang'ali iyotawala isi.<verse eid="2KI 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 11:4" />Lekeni mna ghumwaka ghwa saba mtambika Yehoyada kawakema iwakulu wa ing'ondo wa Wakari na iwabetetsi, waghende kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. Kuko keleghana nawo, na kawalighita mumo mna ng'anda ya IMNDEWA, kuya kawalangusa Yoashi mwana wa mfalume Ahazia. <verse eid="2KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 11:5" />Pfipfila kawalaghitsa kalonga, “Hamkutsa ukukalitsa mna litsuwa lya Sabato, selusi yenu imwe watsokalitsa ing'anda ya mfalume, <verse eid="2KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 11:6" />na selusi ingi ya mwemwe watobetetsa hana lilango lya Suri, na wamwenga wenu wabetetse hana lilango lya kuchughu kwa iwabetetsi. Apfo pfipfo pfamtsobetetsa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA ileke kubenighwa. <verse eid="2KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 11:7" />Makingili aghala meli ighabwihilagha mna litsuwa lya sabato, watsokalitsa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, wambetetse mfalume Yohashi. <verse eid="2KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 11:8" />Mtsomtsunguluka mfalume, aku chila munu kakinda silaha mna ghamoko ghake, na imunu wowose iyobama kuwasoghelela, ayo mumkome ghendo. Kaleni na mfalume, kokose kwayoghenda.”<verse eid="2KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 11:9" />Iwakulu wa ing'ondo watenda ka mtambika Yehoyada pfayawalaghitse. Chila yumwe kaghala wanu wake, na awala iwoghenda ukukalitsa mna litsuwa lya Sabato na awala iwamalitse ukukalitsa, wose wamghendela mtambika Yehoyada. <verse eid="2KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 11:10" />Kuya mtambika Yehoyada kaweng'a iwakulu wa ng'ondo, imighoha na tsingawo itsikalile tsa mfalume Daudi, na atsila itsikighwe mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 11:11" />Nawo iwabetetsi tsawema, kulawa membe imwe ya ing'anda mbaka membe ingi watsunguluka imatsabahu na ing'anda yose, na chila munu kakinda tsisilaha tsake ili wamtsunguluke mfalume. <verse eid="2KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 11:12" />Naye Yehoyada kamlapfa kunze imwana wa mfalume, kamfatsa litaji mwitwi, kamwing'a ghamalaghitso gha kifalume. Kuya kambaka mapfuta na kamsaghula yawe mfalume. Nawo watowa makofi wakemelela walonga, “IMNDEWA yakwike mfalume!”<verse eid="2KI 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 11:13" />Atalia hayahulike iwanu na awala iwabetetsi wokemelela, kawaghendela iwanu awo iwakalile mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 11:14" />Hayasungulile kamwona mfalume kema habehi na ingutso hana lilango lya ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, ka pfaitsoweleke, akuno iwakulu wa ing'ondo wema habei na mfalume watowa malati, na iwanu wose iwali muisi wodeng'elela. Baho Atalia kadegha magwanda ghake kakemelela kalonga, “Konibiduka! Konibiduka!”<verse eid="2KI 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 11:15" />Kuya mtambika Yehoyada kawalaghitsa iwakulu wa ing'ondo kalonga, “Mlapfeni kunze mmwike haghati ha iwanu, na imunu wowose ayula iyomuwinza, ayo yakomighwe,” Kwaapfila mtambika tsakalonga apfino, “Mleke kumleka yakomighwe mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="2KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 11:16" />Apfo wamghogha, wambititsa hawakwingilila wafalasi kuna ing'anda ya mfalume, na wamkomela kuko.<verse eid="2KI 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukughalambuka kwa Yehoyada</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 23:16-21">2 Mmats 23:16-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 11:17" />Kuya Yehoyada kawatenda iwanu na mfalume welaghane na IMNDEWA, na ukwilaghana kwao wawe iwanu wa IMNDEWA, pfipfila kamtenda mfalume na iwanu welaghane.<verse eid="2KI 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 11:18" />Kuya iwanu wose waghenda kuna ing'anda ya miulungu Baali, waighwisa hasi, na waibomola matsabahu yake na pfinyagho pfake pfose mbaka wamkoma Matani mtambika wa Bali hambele ha imatsabahu. Naye mtambika Yehoyada kaweka iwanu wakalitse ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 11:19" />Pfipfila tsakawasola iwakulu wa ing'ondo, Wakari, na iwobetetsa, na iwanu wose wa isi wamuhulumsa mfalume hasi kulawa mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA mbaka kuna ing'anda ya mfalume. Nawo wabitila inzila ila yawabitilagha iwanu iwokalitsa kughende kuna ing'anda ya mfalume. Naye kakala hana ichighoda chawokala iwafalume. <verse eid="2KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 11:20" />Apfo iwanu wose iwali muisi tsawadeng'elela, na isi yose tsaikala tulu, kwaapfila Atalia tsakakomighwa na lipanga hana ing'anda ya mfalume. <verse eid="2KI 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 11:21" />Naye Yoashi tsakana miyaka saba ahala hayanzile kutawala isi ya Yuda.<verse eid="2KI 11:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2KI 12" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Yoashi wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 12:1" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa saba ahala Yehu hayang'ali yotawala, Yoashi kanza ukutawala, naye katawala Yerusalemu kwa miyaka alubaini. Na taghwa lya mai wake tsakakemighwa Sibia iyalawile mna ghumji ghwa Beeri Sheba. <verse eid="2KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 12:2" />Yoashi kamtendela ighanoghile IMNDEWA matsuwa ghake ghose ka apfila imtambika Yehoyada pfayamfundile. <verse eid="2KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 12:3" />Lekeni hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila ng'ahahinyile baye, apfo iwanu waghendelela ukutambika na kulapfa tsinambiko hanu henulighwe.<verse eid="2KI 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 12:4" />Yoashi kawalongela iwatambika apfino, “Tsendi tsose itsighalighwa mng'anda mwa IMNDEWA, tsilawile mna ipfinu ipfelile, na tsisendi atsila tsose itsilaghitsighwe imunu yalapfe, na sendi tsose tsayolapfa imunu kwa ukubama mwenyegho itsighalighwa mng'anda mwa IMNDEWA, <verse eid="2KI 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 12:5" />walekeni iwatambika watsibokele kulawa kwa iwanu iwakwika sendi, na watsengele chila hanu hakoneka hahinyika mna ing'anda ya Imulungu.”<verse eid="2KI 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 12:6" />Lekeni mna ghumwaka ghwa ishilini na tatu ghwa ukutawa mfalume Yoashi, iwatambika ng'awatsengile hanu hohose baye honeke habomoka mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 12:7" />Apfo mfalume Yoashi kamkema mtambika Yehoyada na watambika wayaghe kawalongela, “Heule ng'amtsengile baye hanu hakoneka habomoka mna ng'anda ya IMNDEWA? Lelo mleke kubokela keli tsisendi kulawa kwa iwanu iwakwika sendi. lekeni kulawa sambi tsisendi tsose tsobamighwa tsitsenge hanu aho habomoke.” <verse eid="2KI 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 12:8" />Apfo iwatambika watoghola waleke kubokela sendi keli kulawa kwa iwanu, na pfipfila welaghana waleke kutsenga hanu habomoke mna ing'anda ya Imulungu.<verse eid="2KI 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 12:9" />Kuya Yehoyada kasola chisanduku, katobola ichighubiko chake, keka habehi na imatsabahu, ubali wa kujilo ahala imunu hayakwingila mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. Iwatambika iwakalitse lilango watsika tsisendi tsose mna ichisanduku itsighalighwe kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 12:10" />Chila hawonile mna lisanduku mna sendi nyingi, imwandishi wa ing'anda ya mfalume na mtambika mkulu wang'ali wotsilapfa na wotsipeta tsisendi atso itsighalighwe mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, wotsoha na watsika mna imikoba. <verse eid="2KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 12:11" />Hawomalitsa kutsipeta tsisendi atso, waweng'a iwanu iwasaghulighwe wemilile tsing'onde mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. Nawo wawaliha iwanu iwang'ali wosang'ana mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. Iwanu awo wawo awano, iwanu iwang'ali wotsenga na awala iwang'ali wosongola imibiki, <verse eid="2KI 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 12:12" />na awala iwatsengile na ghamabwe, na wasongola mabwe. Pfipfila waghulila tsimbao na ghamabwe ighasongolighwe, ili watsengele hanu habomoke mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA na waghala chila chinu ichibamighwa mna ukuitsenga ing'anda. <verse eid="2KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 12:13" />Lekeni tsisendi itsighaligwe mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA ng'atsitumike baye mna ukutengenetsa ghamasiniya, ghamabilika, imikasi ya ukuganila utambi wa pfitasa, ghamabakuli, tsimalati wala kwa pfinu pfopfose pfa nzahabu na fetsa pfa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 12:14" />Tsose tsiwaliha iwanu wose iwang'ali wosang'ana mna ukuitsenga keli ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 12:15" />Iwanu iwemilile ing'onde aino tsa wanu wa wakutogholeka ng'ani, apfo ng'awabamighwe baye walonge apfila pfawatsitumile tsisendi. <verse eid="2KI 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 12:16" />Tsisendi itsilapfighwe tsiwe tsa nambiko ya matotso na nambiko tsa ukuleghusa nzambi ng'atsingile baye mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. Atso tsatsikala sendi tsa watambika.<verse eid="2KI 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 12:17" />Matsuwa agho Hazaeli mfalume wa Aramu kagheluka kaghenda kughutowa ghumji ghwa Gati na kaghuboka. Kuya Hazaeli kahunduka kaghenda yakaghutowe ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 12:18" />Baho mfalume Yoashi kasola nambiko tsose tsayalapfile yeye, na tsawalapfile iwahenga wake wafalume Yehoshafati, Yehoramu, na mfalume Ahazia itsilapfighwe tsiwe tsa IMNDEWA, hamwe na nzahabu yose ili mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA na mna ing'anda ya mfalume, katsighala kwa Hazaeli mfalume wa Aramu, kuya Hazaeli kalawa Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2KI 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 12:19" />Ghangi ghayatendile mfalume Yoashi mna ukutawala kwake, na chila chinu chayatendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukukumbuka cha wafalume wa Yuda.<verse eid="2KI 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 12:20" />Iwakulu wake wa ing'ondo wamtendela tsengwe, nawo wamkoma ako Beti Milo kuna inzila ihulumka kughenda Sila. <verse eid="2KI 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 12:21" />Iwamkomile tsa Yozabadi mwana wa Shimeati na Yehozabadi mwana wa Shomeri, iwakalile watumighwa wake. Naye Yoashi katsikighwa mna ghumji ghwa Daudi. Naye Amazia imwanaghe kawa mfalume hanu hake.<verse eid="2KI 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2KI 13" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Yoashi wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 13:1" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa ishilini na tatu ghwa ufalume wa Yoashi wa Yuda, Yehoahazi mwanaghe Yehu kanza kuwa mfalume wa Isiraeli mna isi ya Samaria, naye katawala kwa miyaka kumi na saba. <verse eid="2KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 13:2" />Katenda nzambi hambele ha IMNDEWA, ka apfila pfayatendile Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, iyawahonzile Waisiraeli nawo watende nzambi, naye Yehoahazi ng'atsilekile baye. <verse eid="2KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 13:3" />Apfo IMNDEWA kawaghudubukila Waisiraeli, kawaleka watowighwe towighwe na mfalume Hazaeli wa Aramu na mfalume Beni Hadadi imwanaghe. <verse eid="2KI 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 13:4" />Baho Yehoahazi kamdedetsa IMNDEWA yawonele libatsi Waisiraeli, naye IMNDEWA kamtegheletsa kwaapfila tsakona apfila mfalume wa Aramu pfayawadununze. <verse eid="2KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 13:5" />IMNDEWA kaweng'a Waisiraeli munu wa ukuwakombola, kawakombola kulawa mna utawala wa Aramu. Nawo Waisiraeli wakala tulu ka pfawakalile aho ghumwande. <verse eid="2KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 13:6" />Lekeni ng'awalekile baye ukutenda tsinzambi atsila tsa Yeroboamu, iyawahonzile Waisiraeli watsitende. Nawo waghendelela na nzambi tsawo, na waghendelela kwimitsa chinyagho cha mulungu wa Ashera ako Samaria.<verse eid="2KI 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 13:7" />Yehoahazi maasikali wake tsawamala ghendo, iyakalile nawo tsa wadina falasi hamsini, na mituka kumi ya ng'ondo, na masikali wa ghamaghulu elufu kumi, kwaapfila mfalume wa Aramu tsakawadugha dugha na woneka ka timbwisi ahala hawobeta. <verse eid="2KI 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 13:8" />Ghangi ghayetendile Yehoazi mna ukutawala kwake na chila chinu chingi chayetendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha Ukukumbuka cha Wafalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 13:9" />Yehoahazi kafa na katsikighwa ako Samaria, na Yehoashi imwanghe kawa mfalume wa Isiraeli hanu hake.<verse eid="2KI 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Yehoashi wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 13:10" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa selasini na saba ghwa ukutawala Yoashi mfalume wa Yuda, Yehoashi mwanaghe Yehoahazi kawa mfalume wa Isiraeli aku kokala Samaria. Naye kawa mfalume kwa miyaka kumi na sita. <verse eid="2KI 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 13:11" />Pfipfila Yehoashi katenda nzambi hambele ha IMNDEWA, katenda nzambi tsitsila tsayatendile Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, iyawahonzile Waisiraeli nawo watende nzambi, naye ng'atsilekile baye. <verse eid="2KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 13:12" />Ghangi ghayatendile Yehoashi mna ukutawala kwake na chila chinu chingi chayatendile, na apfila pfayetowile na Amazia, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha Ukukumbuka Iiwafalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 13:13" />Yehoashi kafa na katsikighwa ako Samaria kwawatsikighwe iwafalume, imwanghe iyakemighwe Yeroboamu kawa mfalume, hanu hake.<verse eid="2KI 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa Elisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 13:14" />Nabii Elisha tsakaghula utamu wihile sideke, hambele tsaumkoma. Yehoashi mfalume wa Isiraeli tsakaghenda kumlola, na kuko kamlilila kalonga, “Wenye ghwe aba wangu! Wenye ghwe aba wangu! Mkulu wa ing'ondo wa Isiraeli!”<verse eid="2KI 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 13:15" />Elisha kamlaghitsa kalonga, “Nighalile iminde na imishale!” Naye mfalume katenda pfipfo. <verse eid="2KI 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 13:16" />Elisha kamlongela mfalume wa Isiraeli, “Ukinde ghoya iminde yako kwa ukwasa ghumshale. Naye mfalume keka ghoya, kuya Elisha keka ghamoko ghake mchanya mwa ghamoko gha mfalume.” <verse eid="2KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 13:17" />Elisha kalonga, “Pfughula lidilisha lya mashaliki,” Naye mfalume kalipfughula. Kuya Elisha kalonga, “Wase ghumshale!” Naye kasa ghumshale. Elisha kalonga, “Aghuno mshale ghwa ukuhuma ghwa IMNDEWA, mshale ghwa ukuitowa isi ya Aramu! Kutsowakoma ghendo Waaramu iwali Afeki.” <verse eid="2KI 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 13:18" />Kuya Elisha kalonga, “Sola imishale,” Naye mfalume kasola. Elisha kamlongela, “Utowe hasi.” Mfalume katowa hasi mala ndatu, kuya kaleka. <verse eid="2KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 13:19" />Imunu wa Imulunngu tsakamwonela maya, kalonga, “Ung'atowile mala tano au mala sita, kuya ung'aitowile Aramu na kuimalitsa ghendo, lekeni lelo kutsoitowa mala ndatu.”<verse eid="2KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 13:20" />Elisha kafa na katsikighwa. Chila mwaka Wamoabu wang'ali wakwingila waitowe isi ya Waisiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 13:21" />Haghabitile matsuwa chidogho, Waisiraeli wang'ali womtsika miyao, wona kingili lya iwanu wakutsa kuwatowa, baho walwasa ilukuli lwa imunu ayo mna likabuli lya Elisha. Ilukuli alwo haludonzile imipate ya Elisha, imunu ayula katsilihuka, na kema kwa ghamaghulu ghake mwenyegho.<verse eid="2KI 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi ya Isiraeli na Siriya tsetowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 13:22" />Hazaeli mfalume wa Aramu tsakawadununza Waisiraeli mna ghamatsuwa ghose gha ufalume wa Yehoahazi. <verse eid="2KI 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 13:23" />Lekeni IMNDEWA kawalangusa uluso wake, na kawonela libatsi, na kawalangusa wende wake kwa laghano lyayekile na Abrahamu, Isaka na Yakobu. Ng'awakomile baye wala ng'awalekile baye. <verse eid="2KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 13:24" />Hazaeli mfalume wa Aramu hayafile, Ben hadadi imwanaghe kawa mfalume hanu hake. <verse eid="2KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 13:25" />Mfalume Yehoashi kamtowa Beni Hadadi mala ndatu na kaikombola imiji yose ibokighwe mna ghamatsuwa gha Yehoahazi, aba wake.<verse eid="2KI 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2KI 14" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Amazia wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 14:1" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kabili ghwa ukutawala Yehoashi mwana wa Yehoahazi mfalume wa Isiraeli, Amazia mwana wa Yoashi mfalume wa Yuda kanza ukutawala. <verse eid="2KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 14:2" />Amazia tsakana miyaka ishilini na mitano hayawile mfalume, na katawala Yerusalemu kwa miyaka ishilini na tisa. Mai wake tsakakemighwa Yehoadani, iyolawa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 14:3" />Yeye katenda ighanoghile hambele ha IMNDEWA, lekeni ng'awile ka sekulu wake Daudi baye. Katenda ghaghala ghayatendile aba wake Yoashi. <verse eid="2KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 14:4" />Yeye ng'abomole baye hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila, iwanu waghendelela ukutambika na ukudusula upfumba mchanya mwa chila hanu aho.<verse eid="2KI 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 14:5" />Ufalume wa Amazia hawimile ghoya, kawakoma iwatumighwa wake iwamkomile mfalume Yoashi, aba wake. <verse eid="2KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 14:6" />Lekeni ng'awawakomile baye iwana wa awala iwamkomile aba wake, ka pfayandikighwe mna ichitabu cha malaghitso cha Musa ahala IMNDEWA hayalaghitse apfino, “Aba au mai ng'atsokomighwa baye kwa inzambi iyatendile imwanaghe na imwana ng'atsokomighwa baye kwa inzambi iyatengile aba wake au mai wake, chila munu katsokomighwa kwa inzambi iyatendile imwenyegho.”<verse eid="2KI 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 14:7" />Amazia tsakawakoma maasikali elufu kumi wa Edomu mna Ulwanda lwa Munyu, na kaghuboka ghumji ghwa Sela, naye kaghukema Yokiteeli, nagho ghokemighwa pfipfo mbaka leloli aino.<verse eid="2KI 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 14:8" />Kuya Amazia katuma wanu waghende kwa Yehoashi mwana wa Yehoahazi, iyali mtsukulu wa Yehu, mfalume wa Isiraeli, kalonga, “Utse twitowe.” <verse eid="2KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 14:9" />Lekeni Yehoashi mfalume wa Israeli kamwidika Amazia mfalme wa Yuda, kalonga, “Mbighili itsilo Lebanoni tsituma nume kuna ghumbiki ghwa mkataluba ighuli kuko Lebanoni, kulonga, ‘Umleke imwanagho pinga yakwelighwe na imwanangu.’ Kuya kabita imnyama wa kubagho kaghubajugha mbaluti aghula. <verse eid="2KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 14:10" />Ona ghweghwe kuwatowa ghendo Waedomu, na sambi kotamba. Ghweghwe wighode kwa ukuwatowa, na ukale ukaye yako, lekeni heule wibamila ghamaghayo ighatsokukoma ghweghwe ghumwenyegho hamwe na iwanu wako wa Yuda?”<verse eid="2KI 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 14:11" />Lekeni Amazia ng'ategheletse baye, apfo Yehoashi mfalume wa Isiraeli kalawa kaghenda ukwitowa na mfalume Amazia ako Beti Shemesi mna isi ya Yuda.<verse eid="2KI 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 14:12" />Maasikali wa Isiraeli wawatowa iwanu wa Yuda, na chila munu katsumila ukaye yake. <verse eid="2KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 14:13" />Yehoashi mfalume wa Isiraeli kamghogha Amazia mfalume wa Yuda, imwana wa Yoashi, na mtsukulu wa Ahazia ako Beti Shemesi. Kuya Yoashi kaghenda Yerusalemu kuko kaumwagha ubanda wa Yerusalemu kanzila lilango lya Efuraimu mbaka lilango likalile hana imembe, utali wake tsa futi miya sita.<verse eid="2KI 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 14:14" />Kasola inzahabu yose na ifetsa yose na chila chinu ichoneke mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, na mna ing'anda ya chifalume. Kuya kasola iwanu iyawaghoghile, koya Samaria. <verse eid="2KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 14:15" />Ghangi ghayetendile Yehoashi mna ukutawala kwake na chila chinu chingi chayatendile, na ghamatendo ghake ghana ingupfi mna ukwitowa na mfalume Amazia wa Yuda, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukuwakumbuka wafalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 14:16" />Yehoashi kafa na katsikighwa ako Samaria kwawatsikighwe iwafalume, na Yeroboamu imwanaghe kawa mfalume, hanu hake.<verse eid="2KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukufa kwa mfalume wa Amazia wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 25:25-28">2 Mmats 25:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 14:17" />Amazia imwana wa Yoashi, mfalume wa Yuda tsakakala miyaka kumi na mitano tangiya hayafile Yehoashi mfalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 14:18" />Ghangi ghayatendile Amazia mna ukutawala kwake, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukuwakumbuka wafalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 14:19" />Iwanu wa Yerusalemu watenda tsengwe lya ukumkoma Amazia, apfo katsumila Lakishi, lekeni iwanu awo watuma wanu wamuwinzilitsa ako Lakishi na wamkomela kuko. <verse eid="2KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 14:20" />Ilukuli lwake waludinitsa mna ifalasi, woya nalo Yerusalemu kuna ghumji ghwa Daudi, wamtsika kwawatsikighwe sekulu tsake. <verse eid="2KI 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 14:21" />Kuya iwanu wose wa Yuda wamsola Uzia, iyakalile na miyaka kumi na sita, wamwika yawe mfalume hanu ha Amazia aba wake. <verse eid="2KI 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 14:22" />Uzia yuyo iyaghutsengile keli ghumji ghwa Elati, na kughuyitsa ghutawalighwe keli na Yuda ahala Amazia hayafile.<verse eid="2KI 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeroboamu wa keli mfalume wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 14:23" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na tano ghwa ukutawala Amazia mwana wa Yoashi mfalme wa Yuda, Yeroboamu mwanaghe Yehoashi mfalume wa Israeli kanza kutawala ako Samaria, naye katawala kwa miyaka alubaini na ghumwe. <verse eid="2KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 14:24" />Katenda nzambi hambele ha IMNDEWA, naye ng'atsilekile baye tsinzambi tsose tsayatendile Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, iyawahonzile Waisiraeli nawo watende nzambi. <verse eid="2KI 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 14:25" />Yeye kaikombola na kayuyitsa isi yose ikalile ya Waisiraeli kulawa Lebo Hanati mbaka kuna ibahali ya Araba. Ka apfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli pfayalongile kubitilila mtumighwa wake Yona mwana wa Amitai, inabii kulawa Gati Heferi.<verse eid="2KI 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 14:26" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsakona Waisiraeli pfawaghanzike kwa usungu, yawe munu mtumwa au si mtumwa baye, kwaapfila tsahaduhu munu wowose wa ukuwapfila. <verse eid="2KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 14:27" />Lekeni IMNDEWA ng'alongile baye ka katsoitenda Isiraeli yose ihupe ghendo muisi, kawakombola kubitila mfalume Yeroboamu mwana wa Yehoashi.<verse eid="2KI 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 14:28" />Ghangi ghayatendile Amazia mna ukutawala kwake, na chila chinu chingi chayatendile, apfila pfayetowile kung'ondo, na apfila pfayaikombole imiji ya Dameski na Hamati iwe ya Waisiraeli keli, imiji ikalile ya Wayuda aho ghumwande, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukuwakumbuka wafalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 14:29" />Yehoashi kafa na katsikighwa ako Samaria kwawatsikighwe wafalume, naye Zekaria imwanaghe kawa mfalume, hanu hake.<verse eid="2KI 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2KI 15" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Uzia wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 15:1" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa ishilini na saba ghwa ufalume wa Yeroboamu wa keli mfalume wa Israeli, Uzia mwanaghe Amazia mfalume wa Yuda kanza ukutawala. <verse eid="2KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 15:2" />Tsakana miyaka kumi na sita hayawile mfalume, na katawala kwa miyaka hamsini na mili aku kokala Yerusalemu. Mai wake tsakakemighwa Yekolia, iyolawa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 15:3" />Katenda ighanoghile hambele ha IMNDEWA, ka apfila Amazia aba wake pfayatendile. <verse eid="2KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 15:4" />Yeye ng'ahabomole baye hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila, iwanu waghendelela ukutambika na kudusula upfumba mchanya mwa chila hanu aho. <verse eid="2KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 15:5" />IMNDEWA kamdununza Uzia, tsakana ukoma mbaka hayafile, kakala yaliyeka kuna ing'anda ibaghulighwe. Yotamu imwanaghe yuyo yemilile tsing'onde tsili mna ing'anda ya chifalume, kuya kawatawala na iwanu iwali muisi. <verse eid="2KI 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 15:6" />Ghangi ghayatendile Uzia mna ukutawala kwake na chila chinu chingi chayatendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukuwakumbuka wafalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 15:7" />Uzia kafa na katsikighwa kuna ghumji ghwa Daudi kwawatsikighwe iwafalume, na Yotamu imwanghe kawa mfalume, hanu hake.<verse eid="2KI 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Zekaria wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 15:8" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa salasini na nane ghwa ukutawala Uzia mfalume wa Yuda, Zekaria mwana wa Yeroboamu kanza ukutawala mna isi ya Israeli kwa miyetsi sita aku kokala Samaria. <verse eid="2KI 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 15:9" />Katenda nzambi hambele ha IMNDEWA, ka sekulu tsake pfawatendile. Ng'atsilekile baye tsinzambi tsose tsayatendile Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, iyawahonzile Waisiraeli watende nzambi. <verse eid="2KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 15:10" />Shalumu mwanaghe Yabeshi kamtendela tsengwe mfalume Zekaria. Kamtowa hambele ha iwanu na kamkoma, kuya kawa mfalume hanu hake. <verse eid="2KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 15:11" />Ghangi ghayatendile Zakaria mna ukutawala kwake, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukuwakumbuka wafalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 15:12" />Apfo longa lya IMNDEWA lyayamlongele Yehu lilawila, hayalongile, “Watsukulu wako watsotawala mna isi ya Isiraeli mbaka cheleko chako cha kane.”<verse eid="2KI 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Shalumu wa Israel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 15:13" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa salasini na tisa ghwa ufalume wa Uzia wa isi ya Yuda, Shalumu mwana wa Yabeshi kanza ukutawala isi ya Israeli kwa mwetsi ghumwe aku kokala Samaria. <verse eid="2KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 15:14" />Menahemu mwanaghe Gadi kagheluka kulawa Tiriza kaghenda Samaria, na kuko kamkoma Shalumu mwanaghe Yabeshi, kuya katawala hanu hake. <verse eid="2KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 15:15" />Ghangi ghayetendile Shalumu mna ukutawala kwake, na apfila pfayakomile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukuwakumbuka wafalume wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 15:16" />Menahemu hayang'ali kamnzila kolawa Tiriza, kaghuhinya ghendo ghumji ghwa Tapua, na kawakoma iwanu wake wose, na iwanu wa isi tsose itsitsunguluke ghumji agho, kwaapfila tsawalema ukwighala iwenyegho kuna yeye. Pfipfila kawatumbula wapinga wose wana tsihinda.<verse eid="2KI 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Menahemu wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 15:17" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa salasini na tisa ghwa ufalume wa Uzia wa isi ya Yuda, Menahemu imwanaghe Gadi kanza ukutawala mna isi ya Israeli kwa miyaka kumi aku kola Samalia. <verse eid="2KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 15:18" />Katenda nzambi hambele ha IMNDEWA. Mna ghamatsuwa ghake ghose gha ufalume, ng'atsilekile baye tsinzambi tsose tsayatendile Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, iyawahonzile Waisiraeli watende nzambi. <verse eid="2KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 15:19" />Kuya Pulu mfalume wa Ashuru kaitowa Isiraeli. Naye Menahemu mfalume wa Isiraeli kamwing'a kilo selasini na nne tsa fetsa ili yamwapfile kuutenda ufalume wake uwe na ngupfu mna isi ya Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 15:20" />Menahemu tsakapata fetsa atso kwa kuwananahitsa Waisiraeli. Na chila munu yana tsimali tsakalapfa sendi shekeli hamsini tsa fetsa. Na tsifetsa atso keng'ighwa mfalume wa Ashuru. Apfo mfalume wa Ashuru kaleka ukwitowa na koya kuna isi yake. <verse eid="2KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 15:21" />Ghangi ghayatendile Shalumu mna ukutawala kwake, na chila chinu chayatendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukuwakumbuka wafalume wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 15:22" />Menahemu kafa na katsikighwam, naye mwanaghe Pekahia kawa mfalume hanu hake.<verse eid="2KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pekahia kakuwa mfalume wa Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 15:23" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa hamsini ghwa ufalume wa Uzia wa isi ya Yuda, Pekahia mwanaghe Menahemu kanza ukutawala mna isi ya Isiraeli, naye katawala kwa miyaka mili aku kokala Samaria. <verse eid="2KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 15:24" />Katenda nzambi hambele ha IMNDEWA, ng'atsilekile baye tsinzambi tsose tsayatendile Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, iyawahonzile Waisiraeli nawo watende nzambi. <verse eid="2KI 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 15:25" />Peka mwana wa Remalia iyakalile mkulu wa ing'ondo wa Pekahia tsakamtendela tsengwe. Kasola wanu hamsini wa Gileadi hamwe na yeye mwenyegho kamkoma Pekahia, Arigobu na Aria mna ing'anda ya mfalme itsungulusighwe ubanda ako Samaria. Apfo Peka kamkoma Pekahia, naye kawa mfalume hanu hake. <verse eid="2KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 15:26" />Ghangi ghayatendile Pekahia mna ukutawala kwake, na chila chinu chayatendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu ukuwakumbuka wafalume wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Peka wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 15:27" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa hamsini na mbili ghwa ukutawala Uzia mfalume wa isi ya Yuda, Peka mwanaghe Remalia kanza ukutawala mna isi ya Israeli, tsakatawala ako Samaria kwa miyaka ishilini. <verse eid="2KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 15:28" />Katenda nzambi hambele ha IMNDEWA. Naye ng'atsilekile baye tsinzambi tsose tsayatendile Yeroboamu mwana wa Nebati, iyawahonzile Waisiraeli nawo watende nzambi.<verse eid="2KI 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 15:29" />Mna ghamatsuwa gha mfalume Peka wa Isiraeli, mfalume Tigilati Pileseri, wa Ashuru katsa kaghuboka ghumji ghwa Abeli Betimaaka ghwa Yanoa, Kadeshi na Hazori, hamwe na tsiisi tsa Gileadi, Galilaya, na Nafutali na wawaboka iwanu wawo. <verse eid="2KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 15:30" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa ishilini ghwa ufalume wa Yotamu, mwanaghe Uzia mfalume wa Yuda, Hoshea mwanaghe Ela kamtendela tsengwe Peka mwana wa Remalia, kamtowa kuya kamkoma, kuya kawa mfalume, kakinda hanu hake. <verse eid="2KI 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 15:31" />Ghangi ghayatendile Peka mna ukutawala kwake, na chila chinu chayatendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukuwakumbuka wafalume wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Yotamu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 15:32" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kabili ghwa Peka, mwanaghe Remalia mfalume wa Isiraeli Yotamu mwanaghe Uzia mfalume wa Yuda kanza ukutawala. <verse eid="2KI 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 15:33" />Tsakana miyaka ishilini na mitano hayawile mfalume, naye katawala aku kokala Yerusalemu kwa miyaka kumi na sita. Mai wake tsakakemighwa Yerusha, neghe Sadoki. <verse eid="2KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 15:34" />Katenda ighanohile hambele ha IMNDEWA ka apfila aba wake Uzia pfayatendile. <verse eid="2KI 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 15:35" />Lekeni chila hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila ng'ahahinyile baye, iwanu waghendelela ukutambika na ukudusula upfumba mchanya mwa chila hanu henulighwe. Yotamu tsakatengenetsa keli lilango lya kuchanya lya ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 15:36" />Ghangi ghayatendile Yotamu mna ukutawala kwake, na chila chinu chayatendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukuwakumbuka wafalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 15:37" />Mna ghamatsuwa agho IMNDEWA kanza kumtuma mfalume Resini wa Aramu, na mfalume Peka wa Isiraeli, wakaitowe isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 15:38" />Yotamu kafa na katsikighwa kuna ghumji ghwa Daudi, kwawatsikighwe iwahenga wake. Ahazi imwanaghe kawa mfalume, hanu hake.<verse eid="2KI 15:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2KI 16" />
  <para style="s">Ahazi mfalume wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 16:1" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na saba ghwa ukutawala Peka, mwanaghe Remalia, Ahazi mwanaghe Yotamu mfalume wa Yuda kanza ukutawala. <verse eid="2KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 16:2" />Ahazi tsakana miyaka ishilini hayawile mfalume, katawala Yerusalemu kwa miyaka kumi na sita. Ng'atendile ghanoghile baye hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake, ka sekulu wake Daudi pfayatendile. <verse eid="2KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 16:3" />Katenda ghaghala ghawatendile wafalume wa Isiraeli, mbaka kamlampfa imwanaghe yawe nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa. Katenda pfinu pfa ukudesa pfawatendile iwanu wa tsiisi tsingi, awala iwawingighwe na IMNDEWA hambele ha iwanu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 16:4" />Kalapfa nambiko na kadusula upfumba hanu henulighwe, na mna ipfidunda, na mna ichimbeho cha chila mbiki.<verse eid="2KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 16:5" />Kuya Resini mfalume wa Aramu, na Peka mwana wa Remalia mfalume wa Isiraeli waghenda kughutowa ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, wampfingilila Ahazi, lekeni ng'awadahile baye ukumtowa. <verse eid="2KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 16:6" />Mna ghamatsuwa agho mfalume Resini wa Aramu kaghuyitsa ghumji ghwa Elati kwa Aramu, na kawawinga iwanu wa Yuda. Kuya Waedomu wahamila Elati, na wokala kuko mbaka leloli. <verse eid="2KI 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 16:7" />Ahazi katuma wanu waghende kwa Tigilati Pileseri mfalme wa Ashuru wakamlongele, “Nene na mtumighwa wako na namwanagho ghendo, ugheluke utse unikombole kulawa mna ghamoko gha mfalume wa Aramu na mfalume wa Isiraeli iwonitowa.” <verse eid="2KI 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 16:8" />Ahazi kasola fetsa na nzahabu ikalile mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, na ikalile mna chiheleto cha ing'anda ya mfalume, kamghalila mfalume wa Ashuru, ka nzawadi. <verse eid="2KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 16:9" />Mfalume wa Ashuru kamtogholela chayalombile Ahazi, apfo kaghutowa ghumji ghwa Dameski na kaghuboka, kamkoma Resini, na kawaghala kuna ghumji ghwa Kiri iwanu iyawaghoghile.<verse eid="2KI 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 16:10" />Mfalume Ahazi kaghenda Dameski kwitingana na mfalume Tigilati Pileseri, ako kona matsabahu, na kamtumila mtambika Uria ghumcholo ghwa imatsabahu ayo, na chila chinu pfachili. <verse eid="2KI 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 16:11" />Apfo mtambika Uria kaitsenga imatsabahu ayo kwa ukwigha ghumcholo iyaghutumile mfalume Ahazi kulawa Damasko, na kaimalitsa ng'ana mfalume Ahazi yoye ukaye. <verse eid="2KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 16:12" />Mfalume Ahazi hayoyile kulawa Damasko, kaisoghelela imatsabahu ayo, na kalapfa nambiko mchanya mwake. <verse eid="2KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 16:13" />Kalapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsa iwanyama, kalapfa nambiko tsa ipfijo, nambiko tsa ukunwa, na kamitsa idamu ya nambiko yake ya ukukala tseghamba mchanya mwa imatsabahu. <verse eid="2KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 16:14" />Mfalume kailapfa imatsabahu ya shaba ya ghumwande kulawa hambele ha ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, kaika kasikazini mwa imatsabahu ya sambi. <verse eid="2KI 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 16:15" />Kuya kamlaghitsa mfalume Uria kalonga, “Kulawa sambi na ukughendelela, nemitondo na nemihe ulapfe nambiko ya ukulakatsighwa, na nambiko ya ipfijo, na nambiko ya ukunwa mna imatsabahu aino ya sambi. Kuya mchanya mwa imatsabahu ayo umitse idamu ya iwanyama wose iwalakatsighwe walapfighwe nambiko. Lekeni imatsabahu aila ya shaba nitsoitumila nene kwa ukumlomba Imulungu ka choni chanibamighwa ukutenda.” <verse eid="2KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 16:16" />Naye mtambika Uria katenda ka mfalume Ahazi pfayamlaghitse.<verse eid="2KI 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 16:17" />Mfalume Ahazi katsisoghetsa tsimbao itsimile hana imembe, na kaghalapfa ghamasiniya mna ipfinu ipfikindilise. Kuya kailapfa ibahari kulawa kuna wang'ombe wa shaba iwakindilise na kalika mchanya mwa msingi ghwa ghamabwe. <verse eid="2KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 16:18" />Kwa kumnogheletsa mfalume wa Ashulu, Ahazi kachilapfa ichiswili cha inzila yawang'ali wakwang'ila iwanu kughenda kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA mna litsuwa lya sabato, pfipfila kaidiwa inzila ya hakwingilila mfalume wa Yuda kuna ing'anda <verse eid="2KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 16:19" />Ghangi ghayatendile Ahazi mna ukutawala kwake na chila chinu chingi chayatendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukuwakumbuka iwafalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 16:20" />Ahazi kafa na katsikighwa kuna ghumji ghwa Daudi, kwawatsikighwe iwahenga wake. Kuya Hezekia kawa mfalume hanu hake.<verse eid="2KI 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2KI 17" />
  <para style="s">Hoshea kakuwa mfalume wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 17:1" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na mbili ghwa utawala wa mfalme Ahazi wa isi ya Yuda, Hoshea mwanaghe Ela kanza kuitawala Israeli kwa miaka tisa, naye katawala aku kokala Samaria <verse eid="2KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 17:2" />Tsakatenda nzambi hambele ha IMNDEWA, lekeni si ka wafalume wa Isiraeli iwamlongolele baye. <verse eid="2KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 17:3" />Mfalume Shalimanesa wa Ashuru kaghenda kumtowa mfalume Hoshea, na Hoshea kawa mtumighwa wake na kamliha kodi chila mwaka. <verse eid="2KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 17:4" />Shalimanesa mfalume wa Ashuru katanga ka Hoshea tsakabama ukumbiduka, kwaapfila tsakatuma wanu waghenda kwa mfalume So wa Misiri, naye tsakaleka ukuliha ikodi kwa mfalume wa Ashuru ka pfayang'ali yotendagha chila mwaka. Apfo Shalimanesa kamghogha kamwoha mna ligeletsa.<verse eid="2KI 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghumji ghwa Samalia ghotowighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 17:5" />Mfalume wa Ashuru tsakaitowa isi yose, kapfika kuna ghumji ghwa Samaria na maasikali wake waghupfingila kwa miyaka midatu. <verse eid="2KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 17:6" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa tisa ghwa mfalume Hoshea, mfalume wa Ashuru kaghuboka ghumji ghwa Samaria, apfo iwanu wa Isiraeli waghalighwa Ashuru, kaweka wakale mna imiji ya Hala, na Gozani habehi na ghumto Habori, na wakala mna imiji ya Wamedi. <verse eid="2KI 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 17:7" />Aghano ghalawila kwaapfila Waisiraeli tsawamtendela inzambi IMNDEWA, Imulungu wawo, iyawalapfile Misiri, na iyawakombole kulawa mna ghamoko gha Farao, mfalume wa Misiri, waitambikila milungu ingi. <verse eid="2KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 17:8" />Watenda ghaghala ghawatendile iwanu wa isi tsingi, awala IMNDEWA iyawawahingile hambele hawo, na watenda ipfihendo pfihile pfawaghalile wafalume wa Isiraeli <verse eid="2KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 17:9" />Waisiraeli watenda chinyelenyele aghala ighehile hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wawo, watsenga chila hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila imilungu yawo chila hanu mna imiji yawo, kwanzila kuna ghumnala ghwa wabetetsi mbaka kuna imji ina ubanda. <verse eid="2KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 17:10" />Wemitsa ghamabwe na tsingutso tsa Ashera mna chila chidando na hasi ha chila mbiki. <verse eid="2KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 17:11" />Wadusula upfumba chila hanu henulighwe, ka iwanu wa is tsingi pfawatendile, iwanu awala IMNDEWA, iyawawingile hambele hawo. Wamtenda IMNDEWA yaghudubuke kwa ighehile ghawo ghawatendile. <verse eid="2KI 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 17:12" />Waitambikila milungu ingi, IMNDEWA iyawaghomile, hayawalongele, “Mleke ukutenda apfo.”<verse eid="2KI 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 17:13" />IMNDEWA kawakanya Waisiraeli na Wayuda kubitila manabii na walaghutsi wake wose, kalonga, “Mleke ukutenda ghehile. Mkinde malamtsi na imiko yangu, ka ghamalaghitso aghala ghaniweng'ile wahenga wenu pfaghobama, aghala ghaniwatumile manabii wawalongele.” <verse eid="2KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 17:14" />Lekeni ng'awabamile ukutegheletsa baye, wawo wawa wasughu ka iwahenga wawo, iwalemile ukumtoghola IMNDEWA, iyali Imulungu wawo. <verse eid="2KI 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 17:15" />Walema kukinda ghamalaghitso ghake na lilaghano lyayekile na iwahenga wawo, na apfila pfayawakanyile, waitambikila imilungu ingi ilihela chinu, nawo wenyegho woneka si chinu baye. Wawegha iwanu wa isi tsingi iwawatsunguluke, hata ka IMNDEWA tsakawalaghitsa apfino, “Mleke ukutenda ka pfawotenda wawo,” nawo watenda ghaghala IMNDEWA ghayawaghomile waleke ukutenda. <verse eid="2KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 17:16" />Waghaleka ghose ghayawalaghitse IMNDEWA, Imulungu wawo, na wafina pfinyagho pfili pfa iwana wa ng'ombe, wemitsa tsingutso tsa mulungu pinga Ashera, wamtambikila mulungu Baali na watambikila ipfunu pfose pfa kulanga. <verse eid="2KI 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 17:17" />Wawabititsa iwana wawo wamale na iwapinga mna ghumoto walakale, na waghenda kwa watowa lamli, na kwa wahawi, welapfa iwenyegho mna ukutenda ghehile, na wamtenda IMNDEWA yaghudubuke. <verse eid="2KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 17:18" />Apfo IMNDEWA kawaghudubukila Waisiraeli, na kawawinga ghendo yaleke kuwona. Kalileka likabila lya Yuda liliyeka mna isi. <verse eid="2KI 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 17:19" />Nawo iwanu wa Yuda ng'awakindile baye ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA Imulungu wawo, watenda pfihendo pfihile ipfighalighwe na Waisiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 17:20" />Apfo INMDEWA kawalema iwanu wa Isiraeli na iwanu wa Yuda, kawadununza na kawaleka waghoghighwe na iwanu iwawatowile, na kuya kawawinga hambele hake. <verse eid="2KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 17:21" />INMDEWA hayawabaghule Waisiraeli wakale kutali na iwanu wa ing'anda ya Daudi, wamsaghula Yeroboamu mwanaghe Nabati yawe mfalume wawo. Yeroboamu kawaswangitsa Waisiraeli wamleke IMNDEWA, na kawatenda watende nzambi ng'ulu. <verse eid="2KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 17:22" />Waisiraeli tsawatenda nzambi tsitsila tsayatendile Yeroboamu, nawo ng'awatsilekile baye, <verse eid="2KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 17:23" />mbaka IMNDEWA hayawawingile hambele hake, ka apfila pfayawakanyile kubitila manabii wake. Apfo iwanu wa Isiraeli wasolighwa kulawa mna isi yawo wenyegho waghenda Ashuru, na wakala kuko mbaka leloli aino.<verse eid="2KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waashuru wokala Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 17:24" />Kuya mfalume wa Ashuru kasola wanu kulawa Babuloni, Kuta, Ava, Hamati na Sefarivaimu, kaweka wakale mna imiji ya Samaria, isi ya Waisiraeli iwaghalighwe kuna isi ya utumwa. Waisola imiji ayo na wakala mumo. <verse eid="2KI 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 17:25" />Hawanzile ukukala amwo, ng'awampfukile IMNDEWA baye, apfo IMNDEWA kawatumila simba nawo wawakoma wamwenga wawo. <verse eid="2KI 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 17:26" />Kuya iwanu wamlongela mfalume wa Ashuru apfino, “Iwanu yuwasolile na kuweka mna imiji ya Samaria ng'awamanyile baye chinu chachi chayobama Imulungu wa isi ayo. Imulungu ayo kawatumila simba mna wawo, nawo wawakoma.” <verse eid="2KI 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 17:27" />Kuya mfalume wa Ashuru kalaghitsa apfino, “Umuyitse mtambika yumwe mna awala watuwaghoghile, yaghende yakawafunde iwanu aghala ghayobama Imulungu wa isi ayo. <verse eid="2KI 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 17:28" />Apfo mtambika yumwe iyaghoghighwe kulawa Samaria kaghenda kukala Beteli, na kuko kawafunda iwanu ukumpfuka IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="2KI 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 17:29" />Lekeni chila wanu iwaghalighwe Samaria wafina milungu yawo iwenyegho mna imiji yawakalile, na wayika mna chila hanu henulighwe hatsengighwe na iwanu wa Samaria. <verse eid="2KI 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 17:30" />Iwanu kulawa Babeli wafina chinyagho cha Sukoti Benoti imulungu wawo, iwanu kulawa Kuta wafina chinyagho cha Nerigali mulungu wawo, na wanu kulawa Hamati wafina chinyagho cha Ashima mulungu wawo. <verse eid="2KI 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 17:31" />Waavi wamwika Nibihazi na Taritaki wawe milungu wawo, Wasefarivi wawalakatsa iwana wawo mmoto wawe nambiko kwa milungu yawo Adrameleki na Anameleki. <verse eid="2KI 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 17:32" />Pfipfila iwanu awano tsawamtambikila IMNDEWA, wawasaghula iwanu wowose awala kulawa mna wawo na wawatenda watambika, nawo wawalapfila tsinambiko mna chila hanu henulighwe haukutambikila. <verse eid="2KI 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 17:33" />Wamtambikila IMNDEWA, lekeni pfipfila waitambikila imilungu yawo iwatsile nayo kulawa kuna tsiisi tsawo.<verse eid="2KI 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 17:34" />Mbaka leloli aino woghendelela ukutenda ghaghala ghawatendile ghumwande, ng'awompfuka baye IMNDEWA wala ng'awokinda baye ghamalahgitso, na imiko, na ghamalamtsi aghala IMNDEWA ghayaweng'ile iwana wa Yakobu, iyamkemile Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 17:35" />IMNDEWA hayekile lilaghano na Waisiraeli tsakawalaghitsa apfino, “Mleke kuitambikila milungu ingi, mleke kuinamila, mleke kuisang'anila na mleke kuilapfila nambiko. <verse eid="2KI 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 17:36" />Mnitambikile nene IMNDEWA yaniwalapfile ako Misiri kwa ngupfu tsangu, na kwa ghumoko ghwangu ghuna ingupfu. <verse eid="2KI 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 17:37" />Matsuwa ghose mwalangitse ukughakinda ghamalaghitso ghangu, imiko yangu, na malamutsi ghangu ghanimwandikileni nene. Mleke kuitambikila milungu ingi. <verse eid="2KI 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 17:38" />Mleke kwisemwa lilaghano lyanyikile na mwemwe, mleke kuitambikila milungu ingi. <verse eid="2KI 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 17:39" />Lekeni mnipfuke nene IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu, nene yanitsowakombola mna ghamko gha maduwi tsenu.” <verse eid="2KI 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 17:40" />Lekeni iwanu awano ng'awahulike baye, waghendelela kutenda ghaghala ghawanzile ukughatenda.<verse eid="2KI 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 17:41" />Iwanu awano wang'ali womtambikila IMNDEWA, na pfipfila wang'ali wotambikila pfinyagho pfawo. Mbaka leloli aino iwana wawo na watsukulu wawo woghendelela ukutenda apfo ka iwahenga wawo pfawatendile.<verse eid="2KI 17:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2KI 18" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Hezekia wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 18:1" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kadatu ghwa Hoshea, mwanaghe Ela, mfaulme wa Israeli, Hezekia mwana wa Ahazi, mfalme wa Yuda, kanza ukutawala. <verse eid="2KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 18:2" />Tsakana miyaka ishilini na mitano hayawile mfalume, na kaitawala Yerusalemu kwa miyaka ishilini na tisa. Mai wake tsakakemighwa Abiya, neghe Zekari. <verse eid="2KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 18:3" />Katenda ighanoghile hambele ha IMNDEWA, ka sekulu wake Daudi pfayatendile. <verse eid="2KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 18:4" />Kahinya chila hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila, katsimwagha tsingutso tsa ghamabwe, na katsigana tsingutso tsa Ashera. Pfipfila kambena pfihande hande inzoka wa Shaba iyakemighwe Nehushitani, iyamfinile Musa, Mbaka matsuwa agho iwanu wa isiraeli tsawang'ali womtambikila. <verse eid="2KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 18:5" />Hezekia tsakamtoghola IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli. Tsakuduhu mfalume yungi ka yeye mna wafalume wose wa Yuda, iwamlongolele ghumwande na iwatsile hambele hake. <verse eid="2KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 18:6" />Yeye tsakamnanahila IMNDEWA wala ng'epfile baye kumuwinza yeye. Yeye kaghakinda ghamalaghitso ghose gha IMNDEWA ghayamlaghitse Musa. <verse eid="2KI 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 18:7" />Naye IMNDEWA tsakahamwe naye, apfo katenda pfinoghile mna chila chinu chayatendile. Kambiduka mfalume wa Ashuru na ng'amtumikile baye. <verse eid="2KI 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 18:8" />Tsakawatowa Wafilisti mbaka Gaza na isi itsunguluke, kwanzila kuna ghamnala ghwa wabetetsi mbaka kuna ghumji ghutsungulukighwe ubanda, <verse eid="2KI 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 18:9" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kane ghwa ufalume wa Hezekia, ighuli ghumwaka ghwa saba ghwa ufalume wa Hoshea mwanaghe Ela mfalme wa Israeli, Shalmanesa mfalme wa Ashuru kaghenda kughupfingila. ghumji ghwa Samaria <verse eid="2KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 18:10" />Haimalile miyaka midatu Washuru waghuboka ghumji ghwa Samaria. Agho tsaghalawila mna ghumwaka ghwa sita ghwa mfalume Hezekia, ighuli ghumwaka ghwa tisa ghwa mfalume Hoshea mfalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 18:11" />Mfalume wa Ashuru kawasola Waisiraeli iwaghoghighwe kawghala ako Ashuru, wamwenga kaweka wakakale kuna ghumji ghwa Hala, na ghwa Gozani ighuli habehi na ghumto Haboli, na wamwenga kawaghala kuna ghumji ghwa Media. <verse eid="2KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 18:12" />Agho ghalawila kwaapfila Waisiraeli ng'awamtegheletse baye IMNDEWA Imulungu wawo, lekeni wawo walibena lilaghano lyake, waleka kughahulika na kughatenda ghose ghayawalaghitse Musa imtumighwa wa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 18:13" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na nne ghwa mfalme Hezekia, mfalume Senakeribu wa Ashuru katsa kuitowa imiji yose itsingulusighwe ubanda ya Yuda na kaiboka.<verse eid="2KI 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waashuru wowaghuma wogha wanu wa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 18:14" />Mfalume Hezekia wa Yuda katuma wanu waghenda kwa mfalume wa Ashuru ako Lakishi wamlongela apfino, “Nene nitotsa, uleke kunitowa keli, na nitsokuliha chochose chaubama.” Mfalume wa Ashuru kamlaghitsa mfalume Hezekia wa Yuda yamghalile mabwe gha fetsa kilo elufu tano, na kilo elufi imwe ya nzahabu. <verse eid="2KI 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 18:15" />Apfo mfalume Hezekia kamwing'a ifetsa yose ikalile mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA na mna ihatsina ya ing'anda ya chifalume. <verse eid="2KI 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 18:16" />Pfipfila kaibandula inzahabu iyaikandike mna imihimili na imilango ya ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, kamwing'a mfalume wa Ashuru. <verse eid="2KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 18:17" />Mfalume wa Ashuru katuma masikali wake iwalongotsighwe na iwakulu wawo wadatu, walawa Lakishi waghenda kwa Hezekia ako Yerusalemu. Hawapfikile Yerusalemu wema hana ghumfeleji ighughala ghamatsi kuna litsimbu lya kuchanya, kuna inzila ng'ulu ighenda kuna ichiwala cha ukutsapfila ghamagwanda. <verse eid="2KI 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 18:18" />Kuya watuma wanu wakamkeme mfalume Hezekia yawaghendele, Hezekia ng'aghendile baye, lekeni kawatuma iwatumighwa wake wakulu waghende. Tsakawatuma Eliakimu, mwanaghe Hilkia, iyang'ali yakwimilila ing'anda ya mfalume, na Shebina, imwandishi wake, na Yoa, mwanaghe Asafu, iyakwika tsikumbukumbu tsa mfalume. <verse eid="2KI 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 18:19" />Mkulu wa masikali wa Ashuru kawalongela apfino, “Mlongeleni Hezekia, apfi pfipfo pfayolonga mfalume mkulu wa Ashuru, Angu chinu chachi ghendo chawihuwila? <verse eid="2KI 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 18:20" />Kwakwaghitsa ukulonga longa hela kwako kokutenda umanye na uwe na tsingupfu tsaukwitowa? Angu nani ghweghwe yahumwaghamila mbaka konibiduka. <verse eid="2KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 18:21" />Ghweghwe komlolela mfalume wa Wamisiri yakwapfile, lekeni yeye keghana la iludete ilubeneke, lutsomhoma mmoko munu wowose iyolwaghamila. Apfi pfipfo pfayali Farao mfalume wa Misiri kwa ayula iyomwaghamila.” <verse eid="2KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 18:22" />Hata ka kwonongela, “Twetwe twomlolela IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu!” Angu si yeye Imulungu baye Hezekia iyamwaghile hanu hake henulighwe na tsimatsabahu tsake tsa ukutambikila, kuya kawalongela iwanu wa Yuda na Yerusalemu watambike hana imatsahabu aino ahano Yerusalemu? <verse eid="2KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 18:23" />Lelo utse wilaghane na imkulu wangu mfalume wa Ashuru. Nitsokwing'a falasi elufu mbili, ka kutsodaha kunibamila wanu elufu mbili wa ukuwadina. <verse eid="2KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 18:24" />Ghweghwe komlolela imfalume wa Misiri yakwing'e imituka na wadina falasi, lekeni wawo ng'awodaha ghendo baye kumtowa hata imkulu yumwe iyali mdodo ghendo mna maasikali wa Ashuru! <verse eid="2KI 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 18:25" />Angu mwopfikitsa ukutsa kwangu ahano kuitowa isi yenu na kuitenda ihupe ghendo nene silongotsighwe na IMNDEWA baye? IMNDEWA yuyo iyanongele, “Uitowe isi ino na ihupe ghendo.”<verse eid="2KI 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 18:26" />Eliakimu mwana wa Hilikia, Shebina na Yoa wamlongela mkulu ayo, “Longa na twetwe kwa chiaramu, kwaapfila tuimanya, uleke kulonga na twetwe kwa chihebrania, kwaapfila iwanu iwemile mna ubanda watsohulika.” <verse eid="2KI 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 18:27" />Mkulu ayo wa masikali kedika, “Angu mkulu wangu mfalume kanituma nonge na mfalume wenu na nonge na mwemwe mliyeka? Angu ng'anitumile baye nonge na wanu wose iwemile mna ubanda, iwatsakuja mipfi yawo na kunwa mikotso yawo wenyegho ahala hanitsoitowa isi?”<verse eid="2KI 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 18:28" />Kuya mkulu ayo wa masikali kema kakemelela kwa chieburaniya, “Tegheletseni chayolonga mfalume mkulu, mfalume wa Ashuru! <verse eid="2KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 18:29" />Kowakanya mleke kutoghola Hezekia yawabughe. Yeye ng'odaha baye kuwakombola. <verse eid="2KI 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 18:30" />Na mleke kumleka Hezekia yawaswangitse ukumlolela IMNDEWA. Mleke kufikitsa ka IMNDEWA katsomkombolani, na ka katsotenda ghumji ghwenu ghuleke ukubokighwa na mfalume wa Ashuru. <verse eid="2KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 18:31" />Mleke kumhulikitsa Hezekia. Mfalume wa Ashuru komlaghitsani mwemwe mlawe mna ghumji na mtoghole ukuhumighwa. Kuya chila munu katsakuja kulawa mna ghumtsabibu ghwake imwenyegho, na ghumtini ghwake imwenyegho, na kunwa ghamatsi mna ichisima chake imwenyegho, <verse eid="2KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 18:32" />mbaka hanikutsa kuwasola na kuwaghala kuna isi ili ka isi yenu muwenyegho, isi ina ipfijo, na idipfai, isi ina ipfighate na mighunda ya minzabibu, isi ina ghamapfuta gha minzeituni na uki. Apfo lelo msaghule ugima na si ukufa baye. Mleke kumhulikitsa Hezekia, kwaapfila yeye kowaghutsukila hayolonga, IMNDEWA katsomkombolani. <verse eid="2KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 18:33" />Angu kuna mulungu wa iwanu wa isi ingi iyaikombole isi yake kulawa mna ghamoko gha mfalume wa Ashuru? <verse eid="2KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 18:34" />Apfi ili kwani milungu ya Hamathi na Arpadi? Ili kwani milungu ya Sefarvaimu, Hena na Iva? Pfihi idaha kuikombola Samaria ilawe mna ghamoko ghangu? <verse eid="2KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 18:35" />Angu mulungu wachi mna imilungu ya tsiisi atsino iyadahile kuikombola isi yake kulawa mna ghamoko ghangu? Lelo IMNDEWA yodahatse kuikombola Yerusalemu kulawa mna ghamoko ghangu?”<verse eid="2KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 18:36" />Lekeni iwanu wose wenyamala tulu, na ng'awamwidike chinu chochose baye, kwaapfila mfalume Hezekia tsakawalaghitsa apfino, “Mleke kumwidika.” <verse eid="2KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 18:37" />Kuya Eliakimu, mwanaghe Hilikia, iyang'ali yakwimilila ing'anda ya mfalume, na Shebina, imwandishi wake, na Yoa, mwanaghe Asafu, iyakwika tsikumbukumbu tsa mfalume, woya kwa mfalume Hezekia, aku ghamagwanda ghawo waghadegha, na wamlongela ghose ghayalongile imkulu wa maasikali.<verse eid="2KI 18:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2KI 19" />
  <para style="s">Hezekia komlomba Imulungu yamwapfile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 19:1" />Mfalume Hezekia hayahulike aghano, kadegha ghamagwanda ghake, kapfala ghamaghunila, kuya kaghenda kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 19:2" />Kamtuma Eliakimu, mwanaghe Hilikia, iyang'ali yakwimilila ing'anda ya mfalume, na Shebina iyali mwandishi wake, na iwatambika wakulu, wamghendela nabii Isaya mwanaghe Amozi aku wapfala ghamaghunila. <verse eid="2KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 19:3" />Nawo wamlongela Isaya apfino, “Hezekia kolonga apfino, leloli tsuwa lya ukughaya, na lya ukukembelighwa, na lya ukulighighwa, twetwe tuwa ka pinga iyobama kweleka, lekeni tsingupfu tsa ukweleka kahela. <verse eid="2KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 19:4" />Songaha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako katsohulika ghayalongile mkulu wa masikali iyatumighwe na mkulu wake, mfalume wa Ashuru yamlighe Imulungu iyali mgima, naye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako katsomkembela kwa aghala ghayahulike, naye kokubama uwalombele awala chidogho iwalekighwe wagima.”<verse eid="2KI 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 19:5" />Watumighwa wa mfalume Hezekia hawapfikile kwa Isaya, <verse eid="2KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 19:6" />Hayawahulikitse Isaya kawedika apfino, “Mlongeleni mkulu wenu, IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, ‘Mleke kupfuka kwa aghala ghamuhulike, aghala watumighwa wa Ashuru ghawanilighile nene. <verse eid="2KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 19:7" />Nitsomtenda mfalume yahulike mbuli itsomtenda yoye ukaye yake, kuya katsakuya kuna isi yake, na kuko nitsotenda yakomighwe na lipanga.’”<verse eid="2KI 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume wa Ashuru komghuma wogha mfalume wa Isiraeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ISA 37:8-20">Isa 37:8-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 19:8" />Imkulu ayula wa masikali kahulika ka mfalume koka Lakishi kaghenda kughutowa ghumji ghwa Libina. <verse eid="2KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 19:9" />Kuya mfalume Senakeribu wa Ashuru hayahulike ka mfalume Tirihaka wa Kushi kakutsa kwitowa naye, katuma wanu keli waghende kwa Hezekia, kalonga <verse eid="2KI 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 19:10" />“Mlongeleni mfalume Hezekia wa Yuda, ‘Uleke kutoghola Imulungu wako yaumwaghamila yakughutsukile hayolonga ka Yerusalemu ng'aitsobokighwa baye na mfalume wa Ashuru. <verse eid="2KI 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 19:11" />Ghweghwe kuhulika achila chawatendile wafalume wa Ashuru kwa isi tsose, kutsihinya ghendo, pfihi kwakwaghitsa ghweghwe kutsokomboka? <verse eid="2KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 19:12" />Angu milungu ya wanu wa isi tsingi tsaidaha kutsikombola isi tsawo, ahala sekulu tsangu hawawatowile, ayula mulungu wa Gozani, na wa Harani, na wa Rezefu na awala iwanu wa Edeni iwakalile Telasari? <verse eid="2KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 19:13" />Apfi ilikwani milungu ya Hamati na Aripadi? Walikwani milungu ya Sefarivaimu, Hena na Iva?’ ”<verse eid="2KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 19:14" />Mfalume Hezekia kaibokela ibaluwa kulawa kwa iwanu iwatumighwe kuya kaisoma. Kuya kaghenda kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, na kayika hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 19:15" />Na Hezekia kalomba kwa IMNDEWA, kalonga, “Ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, yaukala mna ichighoda chako cha ufalume, mchanya mwa ipfiumbe wana ghamabawa iwakemighwe makerubi, ghweghwe kwa Imulungu yuliyeka, tsifalume tsose tsili muisi tsa hasi hako. Ghweghwe kuumba isi na kulanga. <verse eid="2KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 19:16" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, ufumbule tsinenge tsako wone, uwambe lighutwi lyako utegheletse ghayalongile Senakeribu iyakulighile ghweghwe Imulungu yuli mgima. <verse eid="2KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 19:17" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, twomanya ghendo ka wafalume wa Ashuru wawakoma wanu wengi wa isi tsingi na kutsihinya itsi tsawo, <verse eid="2KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 19:18" />na wayasa imilungu yawo mmoto ilakale, kwaapfila tsa si milungu baye, kumbe tsa mibiki na ghamabwe, itendighwe kwa ghamoko gha iwanu. <verse eid="2KI 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 19:19" />Lelo IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu tukombole kulawa mna ghumoko ghwake, apfo tsifalume tsose tsa isi yose tsitsomanya ka ghweghwe uliyeka IMNDEWA, kwa Imulungu.”<verse eid="2KI 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Isaya kwa mfalume</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ISA 37:21-38">Isa 37:21-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 19:20" />Kuya Isaya mwana wa Amozi katuma usenga kwa mfalume Hezekia kalonga, apfi pfipfo pfayolonga IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli. Nihulika achila chaunombile kwa ajili ya Senakeribu, mfalume wa Ashuru. <verse eid="2KI 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 19:21" />Nene nomlongela apfino, “Ghumji ghwa Yerusalumu ghokuseka, na ghokubetsa, ghweghwe Senakeribu, na ghokuhighisila litwi lyake. <verse eid="2KI 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 19:22" />Angu umlighile nani na umlighite nani? Angu umkembele nani na tsinenge tsako tsina ichidandali tsimsodolele nani? Kunendela agho nene inili Mwenzeluka wa Isiraeli.” <verse eid="2KI 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 19:23" />Kuwatuma iwanu wako watse wandighe nene IMNDEWA, tsakulonga, “Kwa imituka yangu mingi ya ing'ondo, nidina pfidanando pfose pfa ipfidunda, ona ipfidanando pfa kutali pfa ichidunda cha Lebanoni. Niighwisa mibiki yake mitali ya mikataluba, na mibiki yake inoghile ya misonobali, nipfika mna tsiisi tsake tsa kutali, na nyanga mna mihulo yake mikulu. <verse eid="2KI 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 19:24" />Nihimba pfisima mna isi tsa wagheni na nuwa ghamatsi ghake. Ighamatsayo gha ighamaghulu ghangu ghanyalitsa tsimbwibwi tsose tsa Misiri.” <verse eid="2KI 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 19:25" />Angu ng' uhulike baye ka tsanibama kutenda chinu achino kulawa ghumwande. achino ichilalawila sambi tsanibama ukutenda kulawa ghumwande. Nikwing'a ingupfu ya ukwiitowa imiji itsungulutsighwe ubanda iwe pfilundo pfa ghamabwe. <verse eid="2KI 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 19:26" />Iwanu wake tsawahela ngupfu, watenyuka ghendo, na waumbulighwa. Wawa ka mitsani ya kumghunda, ka nyotela ndekendeke, ka mitsani ikota mna ichiswili cha ing'anda, ighonyala ng'ana ghakule baye. <verse eid="2KI 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 19:27" />Lekeni nene nokumanya, kwaukala, kwaulawa, nakwa ughenda, na apfila pfaunighudubukila. <verse eid="2KI 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 19:28" />Nene nihulika kwa ghamaghutwi ghangu nimwenyegho apfila pfaunighudubukila na apfila pfauli naichidandali, apfo nitsakwika indoano yangu mna imula yako, na nitsokoha chibang'wa changu mna ghumlomo ghwako, na nene nitsokuyitsa kuna inzila yautsile nayo.<verse eid="2KI 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 19:29" />Kuya Isaya kamlongela mfalume Hezekia, “Achino chitakuwa chitango kuna ghwegwe Hezekia, Ghumwaka ghuno na ghumwaka ghwa ilupfi mtsakuja apfila ipfikota pfenyegho. Lekeni ghumwaka ghwa ikacha mtsakuja apfila pfamhanda na pfampfuna, mtsohanda mitsabibu na ukuja ghamatunda ghake. <verse eid="2KI 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 19:30" />Na mwemwe imuhona mna likabila lya Yuda mtsakongetseka na mwakuwa wengi ka mbiki pfaghulapfa imitsisi hasi na kweleka ghamatunda. <verse eid="2KI 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 19:31" />Kutsakuwa na wanu iwahonile mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, na mna ichidunda Sayuni kutsakuwa na wanu iwalekighwe wagima, Kwaapfila IMNDEWA yana ingupfu tsakabama ghendo kulitenda alino lilawile. <verse eid="2KI 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 19:32" />Apfo achi chicho IMNDEWA chayomlongelela mfalume wa Ashuru, yeye ng'atsakwingila baye wala kwasa ghumshale mna ghumji aghuno. Ng'atsakutsa baye na ingawo yake wala ukwika maasikali wake waghupfingile ghumji. <verse eid="2KI 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 19:33" />Kwa inzila yiyila iyatsile nayo, katsakuyila yiyo, ng'atsakwingila baye mna ghumji, apfi pfipfo pfayolonga IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 19:34" />Nitsoghukinga ghumji aghuno na kughukombola, kwajili yangu nene, na kwa ajili ya lilaghno lyanyikile na mtumighwa wangu Daudi.” <verse eid="2KI 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 19:35" />Chilo chicho imalaika wa IMNDEWA kengila mna indalo ya Waashuli na kawakoma wanu laki imwe na samanini na tano elufu, Na iwanu hawalamke nemitondo wona tsing'uli tsa iwanu chila hanu. <verse eid="2KI 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 19:36" />Baho Mfalume Senakeribu wa Ashuru koka, kaghenda kukala Ninawi. <verse eid="2KI 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 19:37" />Tsuwa limwe hayang'ali yotambika mna ing'anda ya Imulungu wake Nisiroki, iwanaghe weli iwamale Adirameleki na Sharezeri wamkoma na limaghe, kuya watsumila kuna isi ya Ararati. Naye Esari Hadoni, imwanaghe kawa mfalume, hanu hake.<verse eid="2KI 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2KI 20" />
  <para style="s">Hezekia kamtamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 20:1" />Mna ghamatsuwa agho Hezekia yang'ali yoghula sideke chidogho ghendo yafe. Nabii Isaya mwanaghe Amozi kamghendela kamlongela, “Apfi pfipfo pfayolonga IMNDEWA, ‘Wike ghoya chila chinu chili mna ing'anda yako, kwapfila kutsakufa, ng'utsohona baye.’ ” <verse eid="2KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 20:2" />Baho Hezekia kahundukila kuna ubanda, na kamlomba IMNDEWA kalonga, <verse eid="2KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 20:3" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, ukumbuke apfila pfanikutendele kwa ukutogholighwa na kwa ghumoyo ghwangu ghwose, tsanitenda aghala ighanoghile hambele hako. Hezekia kalila kwa usungu mkulu. <verse eid="2KI 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 20:4" />Isaya koka hana mfalume, lekeni ng'ana yapfose baye hana ichibwalu cha haghati, longa lya IMNDEWA limtsila, lilonga, <verse eid="2KI 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 20:5" />uye ukamlongele Hezekia, chilongotsi wa iwanu wangu, “Nene IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa sekulu wako Daudi, nihulika chaunilombile na nighona ghamasotsi ghako, apfo nitsokuhonetsa, na haipfika ikacha kutsoghenda kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 20:6" />Nitsokongetsela miyaka kumi na mitano ya ukukala mgima. Nitsokukombola ghweghwe na ghumji aghuno kulawa kuna ghamoko gha mfalume wa Ashuru. Nitsoghukinga ghumji aghuno na kughukombola, kwa ajili yangu nene, na kwa ajili ya lilaghano lyanyikile na mtumighwa wangu Daudi.”<verse eid="2KI 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 20:7" />Kuya Isaya kalonga, “Soleni ng'ambi ya tini mnibandike.” Nawo watenda pfipfo walibandika hana lipute, baho kahona. <verse eid="2KI 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 20:8" />Hezekia kamghutsa Isaya, “Chitango chachi chayatsonilangusa IMNDEWA ka nene nitsohona, na ikacha nitsogheluka kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA?” <verse eid="2KI 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 20:9" />Isaya kamwidika, “Achi chicho ichitango kulawa kwa IMNDEWA, yeye IMNDEWA katsotenda achila chayalongile. Pfii lisisila lilongole hambele maghulu kumi, au lyuye kuchughu maghulu kumi?” <verse eid="2KI 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 20:10" />Hezekia kamwidika, “Chinu chibewe ghendo kwa lisisila kulongola hambele maghulu kumi, leka lyuye kuchughu maghulu kumi.” <verse eid="2KI 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 20:11" />Kuya nabii Isaya kamkemelela IMNDEWA, naye IMNDEWA katenda lisisila lyuye kuchughu maghulu kumi hana ingatsi itsengighwe na Ahazi.<verse eid="2KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wasenga kulawa Babeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ISA 39:1-8">Isa 39:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 20:12" />Matsuwa ghagho, mfalume Merodaki Baladani mwanaghe Baladani mfalme wa Babeli kahulika ka Hezekia yang'ali yoghula na sambi kahona, kawatuma iwanu wamghalile baluwa na nzawadi. <verse eid="2KI 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 20:13" />Hezekiya kawabokela iwatumighwa awo, kawalangusa chila chinu ichili mna tsing'anda tsake tsine ipfinu, fetsa, na nzahabu, pfilungo pfa ukwika mna ipfijo, ghamafuta ighanoghile, ing'anda yakwikila tsisilaha tsake. Chila chinu ichili mna ing'anda yake ya chifalume na mna ufalume wake wose Hezekia kawalangusa. <verse eid="2KI 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 20:14" />Kuya nabii Isaya kaghenda kwa mfalume Hezekia kamghutsa, “Iwanu awo wolongatse na walawile kwani?” Hezekia kamwidika, “Walawa isi ya kutali ya Babeli.” <verse eid="2KI 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 20:15" />Isaya kamghutsa, “Wonile choni mna ing'anda yako?” Hezekia kamwidika, “Niwalangusa chila chinu chanilinacho mna ing'anda yangu ya chifalume. Kuduhu chinu ghendo mna tsihatsina tsangu chandekile ukuwalangusa.” <verse eid="2KI 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 20:16" />Kuya Isaya kamlongela Hezekia, “Tegheletsa chayolonga, IMNDEWA, <verse eid="2KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 20:17" />lola, ghamatsuwa ghatsakutsa ahala chila chinu ichili mna ing'anda yako ya chifalume na chila chinu chawekile sekulu tsako mbaka leloli aino, pfitsosolighwa na kughalighwa Babeli, kuduhu chinu chitsolekighwa. <verse eid="2KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 20:18" />Watsukulu wako wamwenga watsoghoghighwa na kughalighwa kutali, nawo watsoseyulighwa na watsosang'ana mna ing'anda ya mfalume wa Babeli.” <verse eid="2KI 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 20:19" />Hezekiya kamwidika Isaya, “Longa lya IMNDEWA lyaulongile lyolongesa.” Kalonga apfo kwa apfila tsakapfikitsa, “Ng'apfu iwe pfipfo, mana ng'akutsakuwa na ng'ondo baye mna ghamatsuwa ghangu ghanikala mgima.”<verse eid="2KI 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumala kwa utawala wa Hezekiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 32:32-33">2 Mmats 32:32-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 20:20" />Ghangi ghayatendile Hezekia mna ukutawala kwake na tsingupfu tsake tsose, apfila pfayatsengile litsimbu na kuhimba ghumfeleji ghughale ghamatsi kuna ghumji, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukuwakumbuka wafalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 20:21" />Hezekia kahupa naye Manase imwanaghe kawa mfalume hanu hake.<verse eid="2KI 20:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2KI 21" />
  <para style="s">Manase mfalume wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 21:1" />Manase tsakana miyaka kumi na mili hayanzile ukutawala, kawa mfalume aku kokala Yerusalemu kwa miyaka hamsini na tano. Mai wake tsakakemighwa Hefisiba. <verse eid="2KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 21:2" />Manase katenda ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA, katenda pfinu pfa ukudesa pfawatendile iwanu wa isi tsingi, awala IMNDEWA iyawawingile hambele ha Waisiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 21:3" />Kahatsenga keli hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila milungu ingi ihamwaghighwe na Hezekia, aba wake, katsenga imatsabahu ya ukumtambikila mulungu Baali, na kafina ichinyagho cha Ashera, ka pfayatendile Ahabu mfalume wa Isiraeli. Manase pfipfila katsinamila tsinondo tsose tsa kulanga. <verse eid="2KI 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 21:4" />Katsenga matsabahu tsa ukutambikila milungu ingi mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, ing'anda iyailongile IMNDEWA, ka mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu baho hawatsonitambikila. <verse eid="2KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 21:5" />Mna ipfikuta pfose pfibili pfa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, katsenga tsimatsabahu tsa ukutambikila pfinu pfose pfili kulanga. <verse eid="2KI 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 21:6" />Kamlakatsa imwanaghe mmoto ka nambiko ya ukulatsighwa, tsa kamhawi, yang'ali yotowa lamli, yang'ali yolonga na mitsimu, na tsakatenda ghehile ketseketse hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 21:7" />Kasola ichinyagho cha Ashera chayafinile kachimisa mna ing'anda, ing'anda IMNDEWA iyawalongele Daudi na imwanaghe Selemani apfino, “Mna ing'anda aino na mna Yerusalemu, nisaghula kulawa mna ghamakabila ghose gha Isiraeli wanitambikile matsuwa ghose ing'aghotsigha. <verse eid="2KI 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 21:8" />Sitsowaleka keli baye Waisiraeli wange wange kulawa mna isi yaniweng'ile sekulu tsawo.” <verse eid="2KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 21:9" />Lekeni iwanu awano ng'awahulike baye, Manase kawalongotsa mna ukutenda agho ghehile kubita iwanu wa isi tsingi, awala IMNDEWA iyawakomile hambele ha Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 21:10" />IMNDEWA tsakalonga kubitila manabii wake, kalonga, <verse eid="2KI 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 21:11" />“Kwaapfila Manase mfalume wa Yuda katenda pfinu apfino pfa ukudesa, katenda ghehile kubita Waamori iwalongole ukukala mna isi aino, na kawahonza Wayuda pfipfila watende nzambi kubitila ipfinyagho pfake. <verse eid="2KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 21:12" />Apfo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli kolonga apfino, Nitsowaghalila ghehile iwanu wa Yerusalemu na Yuda, chila munu iyatsohulika ng'atsotoghola baye ichilawile. <verse eid="2KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 21:13" />Nitsoghutowa ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu ka pfaniitowile Samaria, na pfanimtowile mfalume Ahabu, na iwatsukulu wake. Nitsoibaghusa Yerusalemu ka imunu pfayobaghusa isahani, na kuighubikitsa. <verse eid="2KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 21:14" />Nitsowalema hata awala iwanu wangu iwalekighwe wagima, nitsowaleka waghoghighwe na maaduwi tsawo wose, nawo watsowaboka ipfinu pfawo na isi yawo. <verse eid="2KI 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 21:15" />Kwa apfila watenda ghehile hambele hangu, na wanenda nighudubuke, kulawa iwahenga wawo hawalawile Misiri mbaka leloli aino.”<verse eid="2KI 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 21:16" />Manase kawakoma hela iwanu wengi, na idamu yawo tsaimema kulawa hana imembe imwe ya ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu mbaka hana imembe ingi. Pfipfila tsakatenda nzambi nyingi, hamwe na inzambi yake ya ukuwalongotsa Wayuda wamtendele ghehile IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 21:17" />Ghangi gha Manase, na chila chinu chayatendile, na hata inzambi yake iyaitendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukuwakumbuka wafalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 21:18" />Manase kahupa na katsikighwa hana ibostani ya ing'anda ya chifalume, ibostani ya Uza. Naye Amoni imwanghe kawa mfalume, hanu hake.<verse eid="2KI 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Amoni wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 33:21-25">2 Mmats 33:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 21:19" />Amoni tsakana miyaka ishilini na mili hayawile mfalume, na katawala Yerusalemu kwa miyaka mili. Wenye wake tsakakemighwa Meshulemeti, neghe Haruzi kulawa ghumji ghwa Yotiba. <verse eid="2KI 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 21:20" />Katenda ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA, ka manase aba wake pfayatendile. <verse eid="2KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 21:21" />Kawinza tsinzila tsa aba wake, kapfitambikila pfinyagho pfayapfitambikile aba wake, na kapfinamila. <verse eid="2KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 21:22" />Kamlema IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa iwahenga wake, ng'aghakindile baye ghamalaghitso gha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 21:23" />Lekeni iwatumighwa wake wamtendela tsengwe na wamkomela mna ing'anda yake ya chifalume. <verse eid="2KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 21:24" />Kuya iwanu wali muisi ya Yuda wawakoma iwanu wose iwatendile tsengwe na kumkoma mfalume Amoni, nawo wamwika Yosia imwanaghe yawe mfalume hanu hake. <verse eid="2KI 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 21:25" />Ghangi gha Amoni, na chila chinu chayatendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukuwakumbuka wafalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 21:26" />Katsikighwa mna likabuli mna ibostani ya Uza. Kuya Yosia imwanaghe kawa mfalume hanu hake.<verse eid="2KI 21:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2KI 22" />
  <para style="s">Mfalume Yosia wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 34:1-2">2 Mmats 34:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 22:1" />Yosia tsakana miyaka minane hayanzile ukutawala ako Yerusalemu, tsakatawala kwa miaka salasini na ghumwe. Wenye wake tsakakemighwa Yedida, neghe Adaya, iyokala mna ghumji ghwa Boskati. <verse eid="2KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 22:2" />Katenda ighanoghile hambele ha IMNDEWA, na kalangitsa ghoya ukukinda ghamalaghitso gha Imulungu ka pfayatendile mfalume Daudi, ng'ahunduke aku wala akula baye.<verse eid="2KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichitabu chakoneka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 34:8-28">2 Mmats 34:8-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 22:3" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na nane mfamlume Yosia kamtuma mwandishi wake iyakemighwe Shafani, mwanaghe Azalia, mtsukulu wa Meshulamu yaghende kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. Kamlongela, <verse eid="2KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 22:4" />Gheluka ughende kwa Hilikia, mtambika mkulu umlongele yapete ifetsa ighalighwe mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, tsawabokele iwakalitsi wa imilango kulawa kwa iwanu. <verse eid="2KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 22:5" />Ifetsa ayo weng'ighwe iwanu iwakwimilila ing'onde ya ukiitsenga keli ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. Iwanu awano iwakwimilila wawalihe iwanu wose iwotsenga mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 22:6" />Wawalihe maselamala, iwotsenga, na iwanu wangi iwosang'ana, pfipfila waghulile mibiki na ghamabwe ighasongolighwe, watsengele ing'anda. <verse eid="2KI 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 22:7" />Iwanu wemilile ing'onde ayo ng'awaghutsighwe baye walonge apfila ifetsa ayo pfawaitumile, kwaapfila wawo tsawanu wa ukutogholeka ghendo.<verse eid="2KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 22:8" />Kuya mtambika mkulu Hilikia kamlongela Shafani imwandishi wake ka kachona ichitabu cha ghamalaghitso mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. Kuya Hilikia kamwing'a Shafani ichitabu, naye kachisoma. <verse eid="2KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 22:9" />Kuya Shafani imwandishi kamghendela mfalume, kamlongela, “Watumighwa wako wailapfa ifetsa iyoneke mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, na weng'ighwa iwanu wemilile ing'onde ya ukuitsenga keli ing'anda ya keli.” <verse eid="2KI 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 22:10" />Kuya Shafani imwandishi kamlongela mfalume apfino, Hilikia imtambika kangaya ichitabu, naye Shafani kamsomela mfalume. <verse eid="2KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 22:11" />Mfalume hayahulike achila ichandikighwe mna ichitabu cha ghamalaghitso, kadegha ghamagwanda ghake. <verse eid="2KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 22:12" />Kamlaghitsa mtambika Hilkia, na Ahikamu mwanaghe Shafani, na Akbori mwanaghe Mikaya hamwe na imwandishi Shafani na Asaya mtumighwa wa mfalume, kalonga, <verse eid="2KI 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 22:13" />Mghende mkangutsile nene kwa IMNDEWA na mkawaghutsile iwanu wa Yuda aghala ighandikighwe mna ichitabu achino ichoneke. IMNDEWA katughudubukila kwaapfila iwahenga wetu ng'awategheletse baye ghamalonga gha ichitabu achino, na ng'awatendile baye aghala ighandikighwe twetwe tutende.<verse eid="2KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 22:14" />Apfo mtambika Hilikia, na Ahikamu, na Akibori, na Shafani na Asaya, wose waghenda kwa pinga yumwe nabii taghwa lyake Hulida, ipinga wake Shalumu, iyang'ali yotunza ghamajoho gha mfalume, na ayo Shalumu tsamwana wa Tikiva, na mtsukulu wa Harihasi. Hulida tsakakala Yerusalemu, nawo walonga naye. <verse eid="2KI 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 22:15" />Ipinga ayo kawalongela, achino chicho chayolonga IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, mlongeleni apfino imunu iyawatumile kuna nene, <verse eid="2KI 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 22:16" />IMNDEWA kolonga apfino, “Nitsoghala ghehile hanu ahano na mna iwanu wake, ka chila chinu ichandikighwe mna ichitabu acho chayasomile mfalume wa Yuda pfachilonga. <verse eid="2KI 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 22:17" />Kwaapfila wandeka nene, na wadusula upfumba kuna imilungu ingi na wanitenda nene nighudubuke kwa ipfinyagho pfawatendile kwa ghamoko ghawo, imaya yangu itsakwaka hanu ahano, na kuduhu wa kuitsima. <verse eid="2KI 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 22:18" />Mlongeleni mfalume wa Yuda iyawatumile mwemwe mtse kuna nene, apfino pfipfo pfayolonga IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli mna aghala ghayahulike. <verse eid="2KI 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 22:19" />Kwaapfila ghumoyo ghwako ghukutama na kwihulumsa hasi hambele hangu nene IMNDEWA, ahala hauhulike apfila pfanihalongile hanu ahano na iwanu wake, ka wang'alighitighwe na kulekighwa uchuwa. Kwa ukudegha ghamagwanda ghako na ukulila kwaulilile, nene nikuhulika, nene IMNDEWA yanilonga apfo. <verse eid="2KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 22:20" />Sitsoghala baye ighehile agho hanu ahano mbaka ghweghwe hautsakufa na kutsikighwa. Tsinenge tsako ng'atsitsakona baye ighehile ghanitsoghala hanu ahano.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 22:20">Apfo woya kwa mfalume Yosia, wamlongela tsimbuli atso.<verse eid="2KI 22:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2KI 23" />
  <para style="s">Yosia kakwika laghano keli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 23:1" />Mfalume Yosia kawakema hamwe iwanzehe wose wa Yuda na Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 23:2" />Naye mfalume kaghenda kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA aku kelongotsa na iwamale wose wa Yuda na wa Yerusalemu, iwatambika na manabii, na iwanu wose wadodo kwa wabala. Kawasomela aghala ghose ighandikighwe mna ichitabu cha lilaghano, ichoneke mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 23:3" />Mfalume kema hana ingutso, keka laghano hambele ha IMNDEWA, ka katsomuwinza IMNDEWA, kwa ukughakinda ghamalaghitso ghake, imiko yake na ghamalamtsi ghake, kwa ghumoyo ghwake ghose, na iloho yake yose, na katsotenda aghala ighandikighwe mna ichitabu acho cha lilaghano. Na iwanu wose welaghana ukutenda apfo. <verse eid="2KI 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 23:4" />Mfalume Yosia kamlaghitsa Hilikia mtambika mkulu, na iwatambika iwomwapfila, na wakalitsi wa imilango wapfilapfe kulawa kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA ipfinu pfose ipfitengenetsighwe kwa ukumtambikila Baali, na Ashela, na ukutambikila pfinu pfa ukulanga. Mfalume kapfilakatsa kunze mwa Yerusalemu kuna ulwanda lwa Kidironi, na lipfu lyake kalighala ako Beteli. <verse eid="2KI 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 23:5" />Kawawinga iwatambika wose iwasaghulighwe na wafalume wa Yuda wadusule upfumba mna chila hanu henulighwe mna imiji ya Yuda na mna Yerusalemu yose, na iwatambika awala iwamdusulile Baali, na litsuwa, na ghumwetsi, tsinondo, na ipfinu pfose pfa kulanga. <verse eid="2KI 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 23:6" />Mfalume Yosia kachilapfa ichinyagho cha Ashela kulawa mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, kachighala kuna ulwanda lwa Kidironi kunze mwa Yerusalemu, na kuko kachilakatsa. Kachidugha dugha chinyagho ichilakatsighwe chiwa ka timbwisi, na litimbwisi lyake kalyasa mchanya mna ghamakabuli gha iwanu. <verse eid="2KI 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 23:7" />Kuya Yosia kapfimwagha ipfiheleto pfa iwamale pfiweghe ipfikalile mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, hanu iwamapinga hawang'ali wodadatsa ghamapanzia gha Ashela. <verse eid="2KI 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 23:8" />Kawalapfa iwatambika wose kulawa mna imiji ya Yuda kawaghala Yerusalemu, na kahatenda chila hanu henulighwe hehe, kwanzila Geba mbaka Beeri Sheba, akula iwatambika kwawadusulile upfumba. Kaimwagha imatsabahu itsengighwe hana lilango lya ghumji, hana nzila ikwingilila ubali wa kumoso wa lilango lya Yoshuwa, mkulu wa ghumji. <verse eid="2KI 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 23:9" />Watambika awo ng'awalekighwe baye watambike kuna imatsabahu ikalile ako Yerusalemu, lekeni tsawaja ipfighate ipfilihela ihamila ipfighalighwe na ndughu tsawo. <verse eid="2KI 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 23:10" />Kuya mfalume kahatenda hanu hakemighwe Tofethi hehe, mna ulwanda lwa iwana wa Hinomu, ili imunu wowose yaleke kumlapfa iwanaghe mmale au pinga kwa kumbititsa mna ghumoto yawe nambiko kwa mulungu Moleki. <verse eid="2KI 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 23:11" />Kawalapfa wafalasi awala iwakalile hana inzila ya ukwingilila kuna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, awala iwafalume wa Yuda iwawalapfile wawe wa mulungu tsuwa. Tsawakala habehi na ing'anda ya mkulu yumwe iyakemighwe Nathani Meleki. Apfo Yosia kailakatsa imituka yose ilapfighwe iwe ya mulungu tsuwa. <verse eid="2KI 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 23:12" />Katsimwagha tsimatsabahu tsawatsengile wafalume wa Yuda kuna ichiheleto chitsengighwe mchanya mwa ing'anda ya Ahazi, hamwe na tsimatsabahu tsayatsengile Manase hana ipfikuta pfili pfa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. Katsimwagha na katsihonda honda na kalyasa litimbwisi lyake mna ichikolongo cha Kidironi. <verse eid="2KI 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 23:13" />Pfipfila mfalume kahatenda hehe chila hanu henulighwe ha ukutambikila hakalile mashaliki mwa Yerusalemu na kusini mwa Chidunda cha Ukuhinyika, hanu hatsengighwe na Selemani, mfalume wa Yuda hawe hanu ha ukumtambikila Ashitoreti, mulungu pinga wa ukudesa wa Wasidoni, na Kemoshi, mulungu wa ukudesa wa Moabu, na Milikomu, mulungu wa ukudesa wa Waamoni. <verse eid="2KI 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 23:14" />Mfalume Yosia katsitula tsingutso tsa ghamabwe, na katsigana gana tsingutso tsa Ashela, na hanu hatsimile tsingutso atso kalundika mipate ya iwanu kuhatenda hehe. <verse eid="2KI 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 23:15" />Pfipfila mfalume kaihinya imatsabahu itsengighwe na mfalume Yeroboamu mwanaghe Nebati ako Beteli, iyawahonzile Waisiraeli watende nzambi. Yosia kaimwagha hasi, kaghatula ghamabwe ghake, na kaghahonda ghawa timbwisi, pfipfila kapfilakatsa ipfinyagho pfa Ashela. <verse eid="2KI 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 23:16" />Kuya Yosia kahunduka, baho kona ghamakabuli kuna ichidunda, kalaghitsa iwanu wakafukule imipate, kuya wailakatse hana imatsabahu na kuitenda ihe. Apfo imatsabahu ayo tsaiha ka longa lya IMNDEWA lyayalongile imunu wa Imulungu, iyaghalongile aghano kulawa ghumwande ka ghatsolawila. <verse eid="2KI 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 23:17" />Kuya mfalume kawaghutsa, “Likabuli alila litsengelighwe lyanikona lya nani?” Na iwanu wa ghumji aghwo wamwidika, “Likabuli alyo lya imunu wa Imulungu iyatsile kulawa Yuda iyalongile aghano ghautendile hana imatsabahu ya Beteli.” <verse eid="2KI 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 23:18" />Mfalume kalonga, “Mlileke, imunu yaleke kufukula imipate yake.” Apfo iwanu waileka imipate yake hamwe na imipate ya nabii iyatsile kulawa Samaria. <verse eid="2KI 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 23:19" />Ka apfila pfayatendile akula Beteli, Yosia pfipfila katsihinya tsimatsabahu tsawatsengile wafalume wa Isiraeli kuna imiji ya Samaria, itsimtendile IMNDEWA yaghudubuke. <verse eid="2KI 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 23:20" />Yosia kawakoma iwatambika mchanya mwa tsimatsabahu tsa chila hanu henulighwe, na kailakatsa mipate yawo mchanya mwa tsimatsabahu atso.<verse eid="2KI 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yosia kodeng'elela Ipasaka ya kukumbuka ukulawa Misiri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 35:1-19">2 Mmats 35:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 23:21" />Mfalume Yosia kawalaghitsa apfino iwanu wose, kalonga, “Mtendeleni ipasaka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, ka pfayandikighwe mna ichitabu cha lilaghano, ichoneke.” <verse eid="2KI 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 23:22" />Kuduhu Pasaka ingi ka aino ideng'elelighwe kulawa mna ghamatsuwa ghose gha Walamtsi iwailongotse Isiraeli, wala mna ghamatsuwa ghose gha wafalume wa Yuda na wafalume wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="2KI 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 23:23" />Apfo mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na nane ghwa ufalume wa Yosia, iwanu waideng'elela ipasaka kwa IMNDEWA ako Yerusalemu.<verse eid="2KI 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pfinu pfingi pfayatendile Yosia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 23:24" />Kuya Yosia kawawinga watowa lamli na iwahawi, kuya kapfilapfa pfinyagho pfa imilungu ingi, pfinyagho na chila chinu cha ukudesa ichoneke mna Yuda na Yerusalemu. Katenda apfo ili yanze ukughatenda ghamalaghitso ighali mna ichitabu chayonile mtambika Hilkia mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 23:25" />Tsakuduhu mfalume ka Yosia mna wafalume wose iwamlongolele ghumwande, na iwatsile hambele hake, iyamtumikile IMNDEWA kwa ghumoyo ghwake ghose, kwa ngupfu tsake tsose, na kwa iloho yake yose, ka apfila ghamalaghitso ghose gha Musa pfagholonga. <verse eid="2KI 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 23:26" />Lekeni IMNDEWA ng'alekile baye kuwaghudubukila iwanu wa Yuda, kwa aghala ighehile ghayatendile mfalume Manase ighamtendile yaghudubuke.<verse eid="2KI 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 23:27" />Apfo IMNDEWA kalonga, “Nitsowawinga iwanu wa Yuda walawe hambele hangu ka apfila pfaniwawingile iwanu wa Isiraeli, na nitsoghulema ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, ghumji ghwanisaghule, na ing'anda aino, yanilongile, ‘Taghwa lyangu litsokala mumo.’ ”<verse eid="2KI 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumala kwa ufalume wa Yosia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 35:20-36:1">2 Mmats 35:20–36:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 23:28" />Ghangi ghayatendile Yosia mna ukatawala kwake, na chila chinu chayatendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu cha ukuwakumbuka wafalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 23:29" />Yosia hayang'ali kamfalume, Farao Neko mfalume wa Misiri kagheluka kuna ghumto Eufrati kumwapfila mfalume wa Ashuru. Mfalume Yosia kaghenda kwitowa naye, lekeni Neko kamtowa na kamkomela ako Megido. <verse eid="2KI 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 23:30" />Iwatumighwa wa Yosia waludinitsa ilukuli lwake mna ghumtuka ako Megido, na woya nalwo Yerusalemu, na kuko wamtsika kuna likabuli lyake imwenyegho. Kuya iwanu wa Yuda wamsola Yehoahazi imwanaghe Yosia, wambakatsa ghamapfuta wamwika yawe mfalume hanu ha aba wake.<verse eid="2KI 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Yehoahazi wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 36:2-4">2 Mmats 36:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 23:31" />Yehoahazi tsakana miyaka ishilini na midatu hayawile mfalume, katawala Yerusalemu kwa miyaka midatu. Wenye wake tsakakemighwa Hamutali, neghe Yeremia iyolawa kuna ghumji ghwa Libina. <verse eid="2KI 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 23:32" />Yehoahazi katenda ighehile hambele ha IMNDEWA ka sekulu tsake pfawatendile. <verse eid="2KI 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 23:33" />Mfalume Neko kamwoha mna iminyololo ako Ribla mna isi ya Hamati, ili yaleke ukutawala ako Yerusalemu, na Neko kailaghitsa isi ya Yuda walihe kodi, wamwing'eghe fetsa kilo elufu ndatu na miya nne, na nzahabu kilo salasini na nne. <verse eid="2KI 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 23:34" />Mfalume Neko kamwika Eliakimu, mwanaghe Yosia yawe mfalume hanu ha aba wake, na kamwing'a taghwa lingi, kamkema Yehoyakimu. Lekeni kamsola Yehoahazi, kamghala Misili na kafila kuko.<verse eid="2KI 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Yehoyakimu wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2CH 36:5-8">2 Mmats 36:5-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 23:35" />Mfalume Yehoyakimu kamwing'a Falao ifetsa na inzahabu iyabamile. Tsakatenda apfo kwa ukuwalaghitsa iwanu walihe fetsa na nzahabu, na chila munu kalapfa kwa kuwinza achila chayalaghitsighwe na mfalume. <verse eid="2KI 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 23:36" />Yehoyakimu tsakana miyaka ishilini na mitano hayawile mfalume, katawala kwa miyaka kumi na ghumwe ako Yerusalemu, mai wake tsakakemighwa Zebida, neghe Pedaya iyolawa Ruma. <verse eid="2KI 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 23:37" />Naye tsakatenda ighehile hambele ha IMNDEWA ka sekulu tsake pfawatendile.<verse eid="2KI 23:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2KI 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 24:1" />Yehoyakimu hayang'ali ka mfalume, mfalume Nebukadneza wa Babeli katsa kuitowa isi ya Yuda, na kamnanahitsa Yehoyakimu yamtumikile, naye kamtumikila kwa miyaka midatu, kuya hambele Yehoyakimu kaghalambuka kambiduka mfalume Nebukadneza. <verse eid="2KI 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 24:2" />Kuya IMNDEWA kawatuma wanu wa Babeli, Waaramu, Wamoabu na Waamoni waghende wakaitowe isi ya Yuda na kuihinya, ka apfila IMNDEWA pfayalongile kubitila iwatumighwa wake manabii. <verse eid="2KI 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 24:3" />Aghano ghalawila ghendo mna isi ya Yuda ka apfila IMNDEWA pfayalaghitse, tsakabama kuwawinga Wayuda walawe hambele hake, kwa tsinzambi atsila tsayatendile mfalume Manase, na ghose ghayatendile, <verse eid="2KI 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 24:4" />kwa ukowakoma hela iwanu, na kuimemetsa idamu ya wanu iwakomighwe hela mna Yerusalemu, naye IMNDEWA ng'atoghole baye kuilekelela inzambi yake. <verse eid="2KI 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 24:5" />Ghangi ghayatendile Yehoyakimu mna utawala wake, na chila chinu chayatendile, ghose ghandikighwa mna ichitabu ukuwakumbuka wafalume wa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 24:6" />Yohoyakimu kahupa na imwanaghe Yehoyakini kawa mfalume hanu hake.<verse eid="2KI 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 24:7" />Mfalume wa Misiri na maasikali wake ng'awatsile keli baye kulawa mna isi yake, kwaapfila mfalume wa Babeli tsakasola isi yose iwile ya mfalume wa Misiri, kwanzila ichikolongo cha Misiri mbaka kuna ghumto ghwa Eufurate.<verse eid="2KI 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yehoyakini mfalume wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 24:8" />Yehoyakini tsakana miyaka kumi na minane hayawile mfalume, katawala Yerusalemu kwa miyetsi midatu. Wenye wake tsakakemighwa Nehushta neghe Elinatani iyolawa kuna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 24:9" />Yehoyakini katenda ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA ka apfila aba wake pfayatendile. <verse eid="2KI 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 24:10" />Matsuwa agho maasikali wa mfalume Nebukadineza waghenda kughutowa ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu na waghutsingila. <verse eid="2KI 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 24:11" />Mfalume Nebukadineza imwenyegho tsakagheluka kuna ghumiji ahala maasikali wake hawang'ali woghutowa ghumji. <verse eid="2KI 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 24:12" />Mfalume Yehoyakini wa Yuda keghala imwenyegho kwa mfalume wa Babeli yakaghoghighwe, yeye imwenyegho na wenye wake, iwatumighwa wake, na iwakulu wa iwanu wake. Mfalume wa Babeli kamghogha na kamwoha kuna ligeletsa mna ghumwaka ghwa nane ghwa ufalume wake. <verse eid="2KI 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 24:13" />Kasola chila chinu ichikalile mna ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, na mna ing'ana ya chifalume, ka apfila IMNDEWA pfayalongile, na kasola chila chinu cha nzahabu chayatendile Selemani mfalume wa Isiraeli chiwe cha ing'anda ya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="2KI 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 24:14" />Kawasola iwanu wose wa Yerusalemu, koka nawo kuna isi ya utumwa, kasola wakulu wose, na awala iwadahile ukwitowa, mafundi wose, wosewose wapfika wanu elufu kumi. Lekeni kawaleka iwahingwa waliyeka muisi. <verse eid="2KI 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 24:15" />Mfalume Nebukadneza kamghogha Yehoyakini kamghala Babeli, hamwe na mame wake, na wehe tsake, na iwakulu wake, na pfilongotsi wose wa isi. <verse eid="2KI 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 24:16" />Mfalume wa Babeli pfipfila kawasola wanu elufu saba wa Yuda iwadahile ukwitowa, wose awo tsawana ngupfu ya ukwitowa, na mafundi iwanoghile, na walubula chuma elufu imwe. <verse eid="2KI 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 24:17" />Mfalume wa Babeli kamwika Matania, ndughu wa aba wake Yehoyakini, yawe mfalume hanu hake, na kamwing'a taghwa lingi, kamkema Sedekia.<verse eid="2KI 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume Sedekia wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 24:18" />Sedekia tsakana miyaka ishilini na ghumwe hayawile mfalume, katawala Yelusalemu kwa miyaka kumi na ghumwe. Wenye wake tsakakemighwa Hamutali, neghe Yeremia iyolawa kuna ghumji ghwa Libina. <verse eid="2KI 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 24:19" />Katenda ghehile hambele ha IMNDEWA ka apfila Yehoakini pfayatendile. <verse eid="2KI 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 24:20" />IMNDEWA kawaghudubukila iwanu wa Yerusalemu na Yuda, apfo kawawinga hambele hake.<verse eid="2KI 24:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2KI 25" />
  <para style="s">Ukutowighwa kwa ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 25:1" />Naye Sedekia kambiduka mfalume wa Babeli. Apfo mna ghumwaka ghwa tisa mna utawala wa Sedekia, na mna ghumwetsi ghwa kumi na mna tsuwa lya kumi, Nebukadneza mfalume wa Babeli aku kelongotsa na maasikali wake kaghenda kughutsingila ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, keka indalo yake kunze mwa ghumji, na katsenga tsingatsi mna ubanda utsunguluke ghumji agho. <verse eid="2KI 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 25:2" />Maasikali waghutsuluka ghumji agho mbaka mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na moja ghwa ukutawala mfalume Sedekia. <verse eid="2KI 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 25:3" />Mna litsuwa lya tisa lya ghumwetsi ghwa kane, kulawila nzala ng'ulu mna ghumji, tsakuduhu ghendo ichijo chochose cha ukuja iwanu iwakalile mumo. <verse eid="2KI 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 25:4" />Hanu hamwe mna ubanda hamwaghighwa, apfo maasikali wose watsuma nechilo, wabitila hana ibostani ya imfalume hala hana lilango ilikighwe haghati ghati ha imibanda mili aku wanu wa Babeli waghutsunguluka ghumji. <verse eid="2KI 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 25:5" />Lekeni maasikali wa Babeli t wamuwinzilitsa mfalume Sedekia, na wampfika mna ichiwala cha Yeriko, tsakayeka kwaapfila maasikali wake wose tsawapwililika na wamleka. <verse eid="2KI 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 25:6" />Kuko wamghogha Sedekia na wamghala kuna mfalume wa Babeli ako Ribila, iyalamle choni chakumtendela. <verse eid="2KI 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 25:7" />Wawakoma iwana wa Sedekia aku imwenyegho kolola kwa tsinenge tsake. Kuya wammwopfola tsinenge tsake na wamwoha kwa tsipingu tsa Shaba na wamghala Babeli.<verse eid="2KI 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ing'anda ya Imulungu yolakatsighwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JER 52:12-23">Yere 52:12-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 25:8" />Mna litsuwa lya saba lya ghumwetsi ghwa tano mna ghumwaka ghwa kumi na tisa ghwa ufalume wa Nebukadneza mfalme wa Babeli, Nebuzaradani chilongotsi wa iwabetetsi wa mfalume, kaghenda Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 25:9" />Kailakatsa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, na ing'anda ya mfalume, na tsing'anda tsose tsa Yerusalemu. Chila ng'anda iyoneke ya munu mkulu kailakatsa na ghumoto. <verse eid="2KI 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 25:10" />Maasikali wose wa Babeli aku wolongotsighwa na chilongotsi mkulu wa iwabetetsi, waimwagha hasi imibanda yose itsinguluke Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2KI 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 25:11" />Nebuzaradani chilongotsi mkulu wa iwabetetsi tsakawaghala kuna isi ya utumwa iwanu wose iwang'ali wokala mna ghumji, hamwe na iwanu wangi, na maasikali awala iweghalile wenyegho kwa mfalume wa Babeli. <verse eid="2KI 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 25:12" />Lekeni chilongotsi ayo kawaleka iwanu iwahingwa ghendo mna isi. Kawaleka wailolese imighunda ya mitsabibu na walime imighunda. <verse eid="2KI 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 25:13" />Iwanu wa Babeli tsawatsitula tsingutso tsa shaba, lighadi lya shaba lya ghamatsi, libigha kulu lya shaba ilikemighwe Bahari ipfikalile hana ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, na wasola ishaba yose na woka nayo Babeli. <verse eid="2KI 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 25:14" />Pfipfila wasola ipfiya, ghamakoleo, imikasi ya ukuganila utambi na pfinu pfose pfa shaba na apfila pfa lidongo ipfitumike mna ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="2KI 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 25:15" />Wasola ipfetetso na tsibakuli tsa ukumitsila, na chila chinu cha nzahabu au cha fetsa. <verse eid="2KI 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 25:16" />Ishaba ila ilawile mna tsingutso atsila mbili, na litololi lya shaba lya ghamatsi, na libigha kulu lya shaba pfayatengenetse Selemani pfiwe pfa ing'anda ya IMNDEWA, tsa tito ng'ani kulingighwa. <verse eid="2KI 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 25:17" />Chila ngutso tsaina futi ishirini na saba. Na ghamatwi gha shaba ighakalile mchanya mwa tsingutso atso, na chimo cha chila litwi tsa futi nne na nusu, na ghekighwa unzolingo wa nyapfu na ipfinu pfa shaba ipfoneke ka matunda gha makomamanga mna chila ngutso.<verse eid="2KI 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanu wa Yuda woghoghighwa woghalighwa Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 25:18" />Nebuzaradani, chilongotsi mkulu wa iwabetetsi, tsakawaghogha na kuka nawo Seraya mtambika mkulu, na mtambika Zefania na wakalitsi wadatu wa imilango. <verse eid="2KI 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 25:19" />Kuya tsakoka naye mkulu yumwe wa masikali na wakulu watano wa mfalume kulawa ako kuna ghumji. Pfipfila tsakamsola imwandishi wa mkulu wa masikali na wanu sitini iwoneke kuna ghumji. <verse eid="2KI 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 25:20" />Nebuzaradani, chilongotsi mkulu wa iwabetetsi, kawasola iwanu awo, kawaghala Ribila kwa mfalume wa Babeli. <verse eid="2KI 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 25:21" />Mfalme Nebukadreza wa Babeli kawatowa na kawakoma iwanu awo ako Ribila, mna isi ya Hamati. Achi chicho ichiwalawile iwanu wa Yuda hawaghalighwe kuna isi ya utumwa.<verse eid="2KI 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gedalia kakwikighwa yawe chilongotsi wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JER 40:7-41:1">Yere 40:7-9–41:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 25:22" />Nebukadreza, mfalume wa Babeli, kamwika Gedalia mwanaghe Ahikamu, mtsukulu wa Shafani yawe chilongotsi wa iwanu iyawalekile mna isi ya Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 25:23" />Iwakulu wose wa maasikali na iwanu wawo hawahulike ka mfalume wa Babeli kamsaghula Gedalia yawe chilongotsi, wamghendela Gedalia ako Misipa. Iwanu awo tsa Ishimaeli mwanaghe Nethania, na Yohanani mwanaghe Karea, na Seraya mwanaghe Tanihumeti iyolawa ghumji ghwa Netofati, na Yezania mwanaghe kulawa Maaka. <verse eid="2KI 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 25:24" />Naye Gedalia kelaha kuna wawo na kuna wanu wawo, kawalongela, “Mleke kuwapfuka iwakulu wa Babeli, kaleni muisi na mumsang'anile mfalume wa Babeli, na chila chinu chenu chitsoghenda ghoya.” <verse eid="2KI 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 25:25" />Mna ghumwetsi ghwa saba, Ishimaeli imwanaghe Netania, mtsukulu wa Elishama, iyolawa mna lukolo lwa chifalume, kamghendela Gedalia aku kelongotsa na wanu kumi, kamtowa na kamkoma. Pfipfila kawakoma iwanu wa Yuda na wa Babeli iwakalile naye ako Misipa. <verse eid="2KI 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 25:26" />Kuya Waisiraeli wose, wadodo kwa wabala, hamwe na iwakulu wa maasikali woka waghenda Misiri, kwaapfila tsawawapfuka iwanu wa Babeli.<verse eid="2KI 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume wa Babeli komlekelela Yehoyakini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JER 52:31-34">Yere 52:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 25:27" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa salasini na saba ghwa Yehoyakini, mfalume wa Yuda ukukala mna isi ya utumwa, mfalume Evilimerodaki wa Babeli hayanzile ukutawala, kamlekelala Yehoyakini kulawa kuna ligeletsa. Kamlekelela mna litsuwa lya ishilini na saba, mna ghumwezi ghwa kumi na mbili mna ghumwaka ghugho ghwa salasini na saba. <verse eid="2KI 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 25:28" />Mfalume Evilimerodaki yang'ali yolongagha naye pfinoghile, na kamwika Yehoyakini yachikalile ichighoda china ukulu kubita iwafalume wangi iwakalile naye ako Babeli. <verse eid="2KI 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 25:29" />Apfo Yehoyakini katsula ghamagwanda ghake ghayapfalile kuna ligeletsa, na matsuwa ghake ghose ghayakalile mgima yang'ali yakujagha hana imetsa ya mfalume. <verse eid="2KI 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 25:30" />Na mfalume wa Babeli yang'ali yomwing'agha chila chinu chayabamile mna ghamatsuwa ghake ghose ghayakalile mgima.<verse eid="2KI 25:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 25" />
</usx>